<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">Job</book>
  <para style="h">Job</para>
  <para style="toc1">Job</para>
  <para style="toc2">Job</para>
  <para style="mt">Job</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Uz gam ah mi khat ana um a, amin Job ahi; tua mipa khu gensiet bei, mi thudih, Pasian giindan siem leh silgilou lah apat a kihemmang mi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aman tapa sagi leh tanu thum anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman belam tul sagi, sangawngsau tul thum, bawngtal loukai thei kop zanga, sabiltungpi za nga, tualeh suoh tampite anei a, tuachi’n ama suolam mite zousie lah a mi thupi pen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Atapaten aban ban a kiha in, a inn chiet uah annkuongluina anei ua, amaute toh nekhawm dawnkhawm dingin asanggam numei thumte uh achiel zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabanga annkuongluina azawtah chiengun amaute ahankhawm a, asusiengthou a, tualeh zingmawng matahin athou a, a unpi ua, miphaza dungzui in halmang kithoina alan zel hi, aziehpen Job in “Ka tapaten sil na bawlkhiel in alungsim un Pasian na hamsiet kha maithei uhi,” achi hi. Tambangin Job in abawl ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni khat Mangpa mai a kilaah dingin Pasian tapate ahing pei ua, alah uah Setan zong ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Hei a kipat a hing pei na hiei?” achi hi. Setan in Mangpa adawnga, akungah, “Leitunga ka vah kawikawina leh asunga ka suhvah ka touvahna akipata hing pei ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Ka suohpa Job na geeldoh kha ngaita ei? Leitungah ama banga nuolnabei leh mi thudih, Pasian giing mi leh silgilou kiheimangsan mi aum sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Setan in Mangpa adawnga, azieh umlou a “Job in Pasian agiin ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang ama leh a inn tualeh anei alam zousie kimvel ah dai in na imkhum hilou ahiei mah? Nang akhut nasepte, na guolzawla, anei alam zousie gamsungah ahing pungta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin nakhut zankhie inlen, anei zousie tungah na khut ha vawi in, aman na maitangah ahing hamsiet ngei ngei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Tua ahileh hoi e, anei zousie tungah thuneina na nei hi, hinanleh ama tungah vang na khut hasin,” achi hi. Tuachi’n Setan khu Mangpa mai akipat in apawtdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ni khat, Job tapate leh tanuten, asanggam upa penpa uh inn sunga nekhawm, dawnkhawma aum laitah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job kungah thangkou khat ahing tunga, akungah “Bawngtalten lou akai ua, sabiltungte akiim ua agamtat lai un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sabeanmiten ahing sim ua, akaimangta uhi, tualeh suohte khu namsau hiem in athat uhi. Tam thu nang kunga hil dingin kei maimai kang suohta giap hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tambang a thu agen laitahin mi dang khat ahing pei a, akungah, “Van apat in Pasian meikuong ahing kesuh a, belamte leh suohte zousie ahaltum siengta hi, tam thute nang kunga hil dingin kei maimai ka hing suohta giap hi,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuabanga thu agen laitah in midang khat zong ahing tung kia a, Job kungah, “Kaldai mite pawl thum a kisuoin, sangawngsaute ahing sim ua, akaimang siengta uhi, keima ngentang suohta ka hia, tam thute nangma hing hil ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuabanga thu agen laitah main midang khat zong ahing pei kia leuleu a, akungah, “Na tapate leh na tanute, a upa penpa uh inn a nekhawm dawnkhawm a a um lai tah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />thakhat in, gamdai lam a kipat in khopihui nasatah ahing laanga, tuachi’n inn ning lite ah ahing sem a, ahing chim a, khanglaite zousie anetkhuma ashi siengta uhi, tam thu nang hing hil dinga suohta sun kei maimai ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job adingdoh a, apuonsil abotkeh a, asam aheu kieu a, tuol a bohkhupin Pasian abeta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Job in, “Kanu naubu apat in guohtangin ka hing pienga, guohtang ma-a kilekia ding ka hi, Mangpa’n apia a, Mangpa’n alamangta hi, Mangpa min phat in umta hen,” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tamte zousie ah, Job akhiel sih a, Pasian zong a mawsiet tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni khat Pasian tapate, Mangpa mai a kilaah ding in ahing pei kia ua, tualeh Setan zong Mangpa mai a kilaah dingin, amaute lah ah ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Heisunga kipata hing pei na hiei?” achi hi. Setan in Mangpa adawnga “Leitunga ka vah kawi kawina leh asuh atou a ka vahna akipat a hing pei ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Ka suohpa Job na geeldoh kha ngai ei? Leitungah amabanga nuolnabei leh mithudih, Pasian giing mi leh silgilou kiheimangsan mi aum sih hi, tualeh azieh bei a ama suse dingin hing gamta sah nan lachin zong agin umna ahasuo tuom sih hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n Setan in Mangpa adawnga, “Vun taangin vun ahi! Mihingin ama hinna huhdohna dingin anei alam teng uh ape ngam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin na khut zankhie inlen, agu leh atahsa tungah na khut ha lachin aman na maitangah ahing hamsiet pai ngeingei ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Tua ahileh hoi e, ama na khut ah a um hi, hinanleh ahinna na khawipieh ngeingei ding ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Setan khu Mangpa umna akipat apeidoh a, tualeh Job khu akengtaw apat aluzang dongin hima huoisetahin apumtuom sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Job in akikhuotna dingin belphou khat ala a, vut lah ah a tousuh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n azi in akungah, “Na gin umna tudet nalai ding na hiei mah? Pasian hamsiet inlen shi suh mai ve” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Job in azi kungah, “Numei mote thugen bangin nagen mawh a, Pasian a kipat in ahoi imu dinga, ahoilou zong imusih diei mah?” achi hi. Tamte zousie ah Job in akam in sil asukhiel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Job khanguol thumte, Teman mi Eliphaz, Shuh mi Bildad leh Namath mi Zophar ten, Job tunga silhoilou tung zousie atheitah un, a umna inn chiet ua pat in ahing kuonkhie ua, kithukimna nei in ama henem ding leh hamuon dingin ahing peikhawmta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gamla kuomtah a kipat a agal mu lai un, amel athei sih ua, tuachi’n aw ngaitaha kikouin akapta uhi, tualeh apuontuolte uh abotkeh ua, alutung uah leivui akibuoh khumta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuolpuong leivui lah ah ama toh ni sagi leh zan sagi sung atouta ua, koiman kamteng khat in zong ahoupi sih uhi, anat thuohna huoisiet dan amu zieh un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua zouin Job in akam ahing kaah a, apien ni ahamsietta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Job in thu agen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka pien ni beimang henlen, Pasal naupang khat pai in, aum kichi zan zong beimang hen, achita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni khu mielna suoh henlen, Tung Pasian in ngaisah se da henlen, atungah zong vah taangda se hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mielna leh shina lim in tuom henlen, Meilum sa tahin khukhum henlen, Avahna zong mielvom keikui in, zau sah hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zan khu mielna sa tahin, man henlen kum sunga nite lah ah, kipah sih henlen, Ha kisimna nite lah ah tel sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oh! tuami zan khu, hut henlen, lungnopna kikou aw zong kiza sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nite hamsiet miten, tuami ni hamsiet henlen, Leviathan phin hang theiten, tuami ni gausap uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tami ni a zingsol aasite miel henlen, khovah ngahla uhenlen, hinanleh bangma nei sih heh, tualeh zing khovah zong mu sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu naubu kot ana khalou zieh leh, Mangbat nate ka mit a kipat, ana phuolmang tahlou zieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Bangding a naubu a pat shisa a, pieng mailou ka diei, Bangdinga gilsunga pat, ka pawtkhiet a, shi pai mailou ka diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangdinga kei hing na dom dinga, khupte na um a diei, Bangdinga ka tep dinga, nawite na um sese adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua hileh dai dide a, na lum ding inga, khawldam a, na i muta ding hi ing a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mun sesate ama ua dinga, bawlpha kia leitung leengte leh, athuhilmite toh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahisihleh sana nei mite leh, a inn uh dangka a dimsah, leeng tapate toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahisihleh bangdinga, khovah mu ngailou, nau ngeh bang a, ahunlou a pieng kiphuolmang, naungeh banga, na umlou himai leeng Aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua mun ah migilouten, buoina atawpsan ua, semgimte akhawldamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua mun ah Thongkete nasan, nuomtahin akhawl khawmta ua, Amauh nuoisiete aw ging, aza nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua mun ah aneu alien, aum khawm ua, tualeh silate zong, apu ua pat azalenta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bangzieh a genthei thuohte, khovah kipie a, tualeh hin genthei mi kunga, hinna kipe kawilaizanga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />shi ding lunggulte tungah lah, shina atung thei sih a, gou kiphum sui sanga, shina hankhuh tou zawte’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Haan amu chieng un, akipah un, anuom uh hilou amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangzieh a Pasian in, dai a imkhum a, alampi phuol a um mi kunga, khovah kipie ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen genthei a, khawi ka sahnate, ka ann asuohta a, Ka thum ka maunate, tui kisung buo bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka zau mama khu, ka tungah ahing tunga, ka giin mama sil in, ahing tun khumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lungnuom in ka um sih a, sip dide in zong ka um sih a; Khawldam in ka um tuon sih a, Buoisietna ahing tung zaw hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Teman mi Eliphaz in adawnga, tam bangin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Koi ahiei khat in na kungah, thu gen leh, dawzou louin na um diei? Hinanleh hamlouin, Koi a um thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai in, mi tampi na thuhil ta a, khut hatloute na hatsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na thu in kipalpuate aphonga, khup zawte zong na khau sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh tu in nangma tunga, ahing tun leh na lungkie a, Nangma ahing khoikhah tahin, na patau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami hilou ahiei mah na giin, na muon na kinepna, tualeh na lampite a, na muonhuoina?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuin thei ngitnget in, ka hing ngen ahi, mawna neilou mi koi, amangthang ngai ei? Ahisihleh mi thudih khu, heisungah sattan in, aum ngai ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima mu dan in, thulimlouna leitang kal a, buoina tu ten, buoina ma a at zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasian huha khum in, amangthai ua, alungthahna hu a mut in, amangthang zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Humpibahnei ngihna, hutumte leh Humpibahnei zau huoite, aw gingte leh Humpibahnei hatlaite, ha atawngsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sa mat ding tahsap ziehin, humpibahnei Hattahte, amangthang ua, Humpibahnei noukai, noute zong akithethangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Tuin ka kungah thuguh khat, ahing tunga, ka bil in tua thu, kaangnou a kigen aza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zankhanglai mengmuna, akipat a ngaituonate ah, mite a imut tuilai tah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zauna leh chitutna ka tungah, ahing tunga ka gu ka taang teng, akiling sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka maitang nawt in, hagau khat ahing pei a, ka chimul ahing thou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua khu ading denta a, hinanleh alim amel umdan, ka theichien sih a, alim dingdan ka mit ha in, amu thei a, asip dingdenga, tuachi’n aw khat ka zata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasian sangin shithei mihing, adihtat zaw diei mah? Asiempa sangin mihingte, asiengthou zaw na diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman asuohte lah nangawn ah, muonna a koi sih a, avansawltahte dihlou a angawh leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Buon inn a teng a, akingahna suongphum leivui hi a, leikha mai a chimgawpte, nah gintat huoi zawsih samva e maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zingmawng phalvah leh khomielzui, kikaal a suhchimit in aum ua, koima theilou kaal in kumtawn in, amangthang denta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Alah ua apuonbuh kaina khaute uh, kiziellawm pieh a, pilna bei a shi hilou uh amah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuin han vawita, nang hing dawng ding, koi ahiei um? Misiengthou koipen kunga, kihei ding na hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungthahna in, mi maw a that leenga, thangsietna in, mimawl asulumzel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima’n mimote, huihahdan ka muta a, hinanleh atenna inn uh aw sie, kalaw khum zuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Atate uh, bitna apat gamlapi ah aum ua, Kul kotkha phungah totchil in, a um ua amauh hundoh ding, koima a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilkielten a bu lahsa, ling leh khau lah a, akhonkhawmte nasan, anehkhawng pieh ua, tualeh dangtahten, anei alam uh dugaw in, alunggul uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen gimthuohna khu, leivui apat hing pawtdoh, ahi sih a buoina zong leilah a, hing mengdoh ahi dieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meisi khu tunglam a, alentou bangin Mihingte khu, abuoi ding mawnga, hing pieng ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Kei vangin Pasian ka sui dinga, tualeh ka tungtang thu Pasian, ka aapta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman suikhiet guollou, sil thupite leh sim seng guollou, sil lamdangte abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman leitungah guo azu sah a, lou lai lah ah zong tui aluongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ngiemte adomsanga, da leh kap a umte, bitna mun ah adomtou zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman mi lepchiete tupna, achimaw sah a, mi pilkhelte khut in lawchinna, amu sah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman mipilte alepchie na uah, aman a mi pilkhelte siltup, aphietmang pieh vadang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sun lai in mielna atuoh ua, suntanglai in zong zanlai bangin, akimaimaw sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanleh aman mi tasamte khu, namsau akipat leh, mihat kamsung akipat leh, akhut ua kipat in ahunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n mi gentheiten, kinepna anei ua, tualeh thudihlou a, vaihawmna in akam ahum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, Pasian in mi aphawhhila, abawlhoite khu mi nuomsa ahi uhi. Tuaziehin bangkimbawltheipa, thununna khu simmaw vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen aman aliem sah a, Ama main atuom kia a, Aman asuliem a, ama khut mama in adamsah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman nangma buoina, guh lah a pat in ahing hunkhe dinga, asagina ah sietna in nangma, ahing khoikha nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kielpi ahing tun chiengin, Aman shina apat in, nang ahing tankhe dinga, tualeh Kidou chiengin zong, namsau apat in, nang ahing hunkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ham gilou a kizeptuona lah a pat in, phuol in na um dinga, Sietna ahing tun chiengin zong, na zau sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sietna leh, kielna na nuisanta dinga, leitung gamsate zong, na giing nawnta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen gamlah suongte toh, na kithutuohta ding ua, tualeh gamsa hangte zong, nang toh kilem in a umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na puonbuh agalmuongta, chi na theita dinga, na umna huongsungte na ve dinga, akimlou bangma na mu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na hahlesuonte tampi ahi ding, chi na thei dinga, na suon napah phatdan pen leitunga, hampa pou bang ahing hiding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kum ching tah leh teh kun in, na han lam na zuon dinga, ahuntah a bu phuol a, buphai lahkhawm bang mai ding, na hita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Envawi, tami kouten ka suikheta ua, tami adih ahi tuazieh in, Ngaikhie inlen, nanga dinga hoi ahi” chi thei in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Oh! ka lungkhamnate buhin umta henlen, ka vangsietnate phala ah, kikoikhawm ta mai leh, china inge maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipi pieu a senel sangin zong, gihzaw tham ding hiven, tuaziehin ka thugente ahuham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen bangkimbawltheipa, thaltangte keima ah ataang a, ka hagau in agu uh adawn a, Pasian zauhuoinate kei hing douin, akiguolta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gamsabiltung in loupa a nehlai in, aham ngai amah, ahisihleh bawngtal a ann neh tungah, aham ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gimnam neilou chi sawlou in, akine ngai amah? ahisihleh aatui kaang ah, tuina mawngmawng a um amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hinna in akhoikhah nuom lou silte, Kei dingin ann kidahhuoi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka ngetna mu thei hitama leng aw, Pasian in ka lunggulte, hing pe ding hileh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasian in hing gawtguoi nuom hi henlen, akhut zankhie in, hing sattan mai leh aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n zong lungmuonna ka nei nalai dinga, ahi, lungkham natna ah ka kipah ding hi, hing khawi sih heh, aziehpen Misiengthoupa thute ka iim sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang thahatna nei a, kinem nalai ding ka hiei? Bang kinepna nei a, thuoh kenkon ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka hatna khu suong thahatna ahiei mah? Ka tahsa zong sum-eng ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kipanpi theina keima ah umlou ahiei mah? Tualeh thahatna kei akipat delmang ahita amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Suhgenthei a umpa kungah, alawmpa’n hepina asulang ding a, hinanleh aman Bangkimbawlthei zauna ataisanta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka unauten luita tuiging bangin, ahing lepchiesanta ua, Luita tui bangin aluongmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuate vuakhal ziehin avom gawpta a, tualeh vuakhal azunmang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kholum hun chiengin a zun mang ua, khokhal chiengin aumna ua pat aluongmang siengta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khuolzin mite alampi ua pat apiel ua, gamse lah ah apei ua, amangthangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tema ganta vanpuo kizuiten tui umna asui ua, Seba summetbawl a khuolzin miten, kinepna asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Akimuon zieh un alungketa ua, tua mun atung ua. Abuoita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuamabangin tuin noute zong, kei hing panpi dinga phatuomlou na hi ua, ka tunga sietna tungte na mu ua, na zauta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hing pie un, ahisihleh na nei nalam ua-pat, kipahman kei-a dingin hing pie un, ka chi eimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahisihleh melma khut apat in hing hundoh un, ahisihleh ahing sugenthei khut apat in; hing tandoh un, ka chi ngai a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Hing hil un, tuachi’n ka sip khin khian ding hi; hing theisiem sah un, bang kachi suhkhel ahiei mah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thudih thute hat hina va-ia e. Hinanleh nang mawsahnate uh, bangchibang mawsahna ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thute mawsahna ngen a na ngaisut ahiei mah? Michimawte thugen hui bang bep ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tagate tung nangawn ah, ai na-san nuom ua, na khanguolpa na ngawn uh van deh bangin, na deh ut nalai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Tuaziehin tuin hepitah in, kei hing enta un, aziehpen na mai uah zuou ka gen sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuin kihei kia mai un, ka hing ngen ahi, sildihlou hida heh, tuin kihei mai un, ka dihtatna khu ading det hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka lei ah dihlouna a umkha amah? Ka lei in silhoilou atheikhen thei sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Mihingin leitungah semgimlou ahiei mah? Anite kithalaw mi nite bang hilou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sila in nitum kaal angahla bangin, kithalaw a nasem mi in, athaman angahla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n bangmalou hate tang dinga guot ka hia, tualeh zan lungkhamhuoite ka tanvou ahita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lupsuh chiengin, bangchih chiengin ka thou diei? tualeh bangchih chiengin zan abei diei? ka chi a, ning kitel in phalvah tandong kilumle nain ka dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tahsa pumpi than leh leivui khal in atuom a, ka vun akeh a, ahitol gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nite khu siemgan mite khothei sangin agangzaw a, tualeh kinepna umlou a zat bei zel ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka hinna khu khatvei nah-huha bang giep ahi, chi thei ngitnget inlen, ka mitin silhoite amukia nawnta sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tu a hing en mitin, kei ahing nuamu nawn sih dinga, na mit a na hing et laitah in, kei ka um nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meilum alenmanga, a um nawnlou bangin, hankhuh sunga peisuh mi koima ahing peitou kia nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A inn lamah a kinuale kia nawn sih ding a, aumna mun in, ama athei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ka kam ka hum sih dinga, ka lungsim gimna ah thu ka gen ding a, ka hagau gentheina ah ka phun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei tuipi ka hiei mah? ahisihleh, tuipi a ganhing ginhuoi ka hiei mah? Tambanga ka tunga vengmi na koi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lupna in hing hamuon nava, ka touna in lungkim lou-a ka phunnate, phadawmsah nava ka chi chieng nangawn in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangman, mang zauhuoi na hing mansah a, mengmuna chizathuoi na hing musah se se hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka hinnain kilawlmehlup atel zaw a, hinna sangin shina atel zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka hinna ka chimtah a, ka hing den nuom sih hi, Keima tangin hing umsah khinkhien in, ka damsung nite nah-hu bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihingte bang ahi va-ia a, tambanga na thupi bawl a, hichi talawm a na ngaisah va-ia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zingmawng chin a na ve a, mitphietkaal chin a na ze et e?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bangtan vei hing le-ngatsan lou ding na hiei? ahisihleh ka chil kaval masang sie-a, keima tanga hing umsah lou ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ana khielta ka hileh, na tunga khelna ka bawl bang ahiei? Aw nang mihing vengpa, bang dinga muichiema nang nei a ahiei? Nanga dingin puohgih ka suohkhata amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh a ka tatkhelna ngaidamlou a, ka gitlounate lamanglou na hiei? Aziehpen tuin leivui a lum paita ding ka hi a, tualeh na hing sui dinga, hinanleh ka um nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shuhmi Bildad in adawnga. Tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangtan vei ahiei tam thute na gen nahlai ding, na kam a na thugente huipi hattah abah nalai ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasian in thukhenna alehei kawi amah? ahisihleh bangkimbawltheipa’n thudih alehei kawi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na tate ama tunga akhel uleh, atatkhelna zieh un amauh apaimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian na sui a, bangkimbawltheipa kunga thumna na nei pou-leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang pen siengthou leh thudih mi nahi pouleh, ama nanga dingin pellou in adingdoh dinga, na mun dihtah ah hing tungding kia ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kipatna neunou hinan leh, na ni nukhia lam ah na hing thupi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Khang masate kansui kia inlen, tualeh apulepate un ana mukhietsate uh, ngaituo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen eite zani mi bangma theilou ihi ua, aziehpen leitung idam sung nite uh, nihim bang giap ahibou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauten nang ahing hil un, a hing theisah sih ding uh amah? Tualeh atheisiemna ua pat in, thute agendoh sih ding uh a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chihnawng umlouna ah, laiphai akhangdoh thei eimah? Tui umlouna ah, pumpeng akhanghoithei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />sattan lou a pape a apah lai in zong, hampa dangte sangin avuoi masa zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuabangmain Pasian manghilte lampi a um hi. Pasian neiloute lam etna zong, tuabangin abeimang leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Akimuonna khu sattan in a um ding a, akingamna zong momlen bang ahi giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ainn ah akingam a, hinanleh a ding sih ding hi, atudet kenkon a, hinanleh ahou zou tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama khu nisa nuoi ah ahing ngingei a, abate a huonsung ah azam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahuite suong kichiengte viel in azam a, suongpite lah ah mun asui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amun ua kipat suhsiet, ahi chiengun leh, tua mun in nou ka hing mu ngaisih, chiin ana nuol ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngaivawi, tamte khu adamsung kipahna lampite uh ahi. Tualeh leitunga kipat adangte ahing poudoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, Pasian in gensiet banglou mi khu a nuol sih dinga, tualeh silgilou bawl mi khut zong apanpi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aman na kam nuina in adim sah dinga, na lei zong nuomna in adim sah nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma hing mudaten zumna puon asil ding ua, tualeh migiloute puonbuh zong aum nawn sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawnga, tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Adihtah in tuachi ahi chi ka thei hi, hinanleh Pasian masangah, ashithei mi bang achi dihtat thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khat in ama kinielpi ut taleh, tul khat vei lah ah khat vei zong, ama a dawng thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama lungtang piltah ahi a, hatna nei ahia, koi ahiei ama kinielpi a zou ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aman muolte asuonkhie a, lungthah a amauh alumle laiin, athei sih uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leitung aumna mun apat a nuhthopa, akhuomte akinuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman ni kungah thu apie a, ahing suohta sih hi. Aasi taangte zong akhukhum a, ataang nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama bouin vante azahkhie a, tuipi kihawtte tungah apei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman Jangkhuo leh bawmluoi leh Zuheisuhtun, tualeh simlam aasi umkhawmna munte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman theisenglou sil thupite abawl a, sil lamdang simsenglou tamtah a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />En vawi, ama ka kungah a pei a, ama ka mu sih a, ama ka kunga apei lai in, ka theidoh tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aman alahmang leh, koi ahiei ama khaam ngam ding? Koi ahiei ama kunga, bang ahiei na bawl chi ngam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Pasian in alungthahna, heimang lou hitaleh, mi panpi Rahabte zong, a nuoi ah akun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei bang bepin, bangchin ama ka dawng ngam in, ama toh ngaituokhawm dingin, ka thute ka tel ngam diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mawna neilou hitamananleng, ama ka dawng ngam sih ding, kei siemmaw hing tangsahpa kungah, ahepina ka ngen zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama ka hat chiengleh, kei eina dawnga, ka aw hing ngaikhiet pieh dingin, ka gingta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman khopihuiin ahing nuoigawp sah a, ka liemnate aziehbei in abelap nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman ka nah ding ahing phal sih a, sietna leh khatna in, ahing tuomdim sah zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatna thu a kidem ding hitaleh, ama athahatpa ahi a, thudih a vaihawmna ahileh, koi ahiei ama han ngam ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mawna neilou hitaleng, ka kam in siemlou hing tang sah ding a, gensietbei hita leng zong, ka kam mama in, na khielna hi chiin ei ngawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mawna neilou hinan leng zong, keima ka ki awlmaw sih a, ka hinna ka kidah gawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aunpi in silkhat ahia, tuaziehin mawna neiloute leh, migiloute zong aman akibangin, asumangthang tuoh tuoh hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuohsietnain thakhat in, shina tun ta leh, aman mawna neiloute, gentheina khu anuisan giap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitung khu migiloute khut a piehkhiet ahi a, aman thukhente mit atuom pieh a, tua khu ama ahisihleh koi dang ahita diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Ka nite lah mi taihat sangin agang zaw a, aleengmang ua, silhoi amu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka hinna khu tembawh taihat abang a, asamat ding gangtah a bawsuh, muvanlai abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka phunnate manghil ta vang in, Ka lunggimna nuasie in, maitaitahin umta vang chinan leeng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka thuohgimna zousie khu, giin pen in ka nei a, aziehpen mawna neilou, nang chi tuomlou ding uh, ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Siemmaw tang veve ding lah ka hia, bangdinga amawh a gimna thuoh ding ka hiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sabon in kisil sieng in, ka khutte tang al in silsieng nanleng zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Khuchi pum in zong nang man guomsunga, buonnawi lah ah nang die lut veve dinga; Ka puon sillai nasan in zong, kei ahing kidah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama ka dawn thei ding leh, thukhenna mun a, kei toh zawhkhawm thei dingin, Ama lah kei banga mihing a hi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Koutegel kikaal a phit mut ngam ding leh, khut ha ngam ding mi um mai leh izaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kei akipat in, Pasian chieng lamang ding, mi um mai leh maw, azauhuoina in, hing zausah nawn lou ding hiven,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuahileh ama zaulou a, hamngamta ding hi inga, aziehpen kei tuabang mi ka hisih, chi ka ki thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka hagau in, ka hinna mama a chimtah a, ka nop kaningin ka kiphun ding a, ka hinna aichimkha bang kawm in, thu ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasian kungah hing mawsah sinlen, bangdinga nang doubawl ahiei mah hing theisah zaw in ka chi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nuoisie tah a nang suh genthei a, na khut nasepna na simmaw a, tualeh migiloute lemguotna na kipahpi khu, Nanga dingin ahoi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang tahsa mit na nei amah? Nang mihingte mu thei bangin, na muthei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nite mihingte nite bang ahiei mah? Nakumte zong, mihingte kumte bang ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka gitlounate na kansui a, kakhelnate na sui-lumle paupau,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mawlou ka hi chi thei nanlachin zong, koiman lah na khut apan, hing hunkhe thei vawtlou dinga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na khutten kei na hing siem, na hing bawla, ahinlah na hing sumang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tungman banga na hing bawl kahi dan, thei ngitnget inlen, tualeh kei leivui hing suoh sah kia ding, na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nawitui banga na hing sunkhiet a, nawituidat banga na hing lomkhawm, ka hi sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vun leh tahsa in na hing tuom a, gu leh thahuite in na hing phankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangman hinna leh itna tullou na hing pie a, na kepna ziehin ka hagau humbit ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh na lungtang sungah, tam silte na phuol a; tamte nangma lungsim ah a um chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka khel chiengin lah na hing chiemte ding a, ka thulimlouna apat na hing ha vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka gitlou leh ka tung agih a, ka dihtat leh ka lutang ka phong ngam sih ding a, buoina in ka dim hi, tuazieh in ka thuoh gimna en mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lutang ka sang koi chiengin, nang humpibahnei savai bangin na hing vai a, ka tungah lamdang tahin na hing kitheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima dou dingin thei pimi na bawltha zela, tualeh ka tungah na thangpaina, na belap sem sem a, kei hing dou ding galkap hon tha, na hing sawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Bangdinga naubu sunga pat a, hing na lakhie na hiei? Koima hing mu masanga, na shi hita mai zawleng maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ana um khalou ma bang tading hi’ng a, naubu apat hankhuh a puohtung hita ding hi’ng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka damsung nite tawmnou khat hitalou amah? Themkhat beeh lungnop a ka um theina dingin, keima tangin hing umsah khinkhian mai ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hing kinuale nawnlouna gam ka zot masang, mielna leh shina limguom sapi gam ka tun masangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />khovah na ngawn khomiel toh akibahna gam lungzinna leh buoina gam ka pei masangin,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Namath mi Zophar in adawnga, tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Thu hizata a tam kigente dawnlou a um ding ahiei mah, tualeh mi kamhat in siem tang ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na zuou thugente in midangte daisah ding ahiei mah? Na simmaw chiengin, koima’n nang hing zumsahlou ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen nang ka thuhilte asiengthou a, Pasian mitmu ah ka sieng hi, na chi viel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian hing hamkhie henlen, na tungah akam hing kaah tama leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apilna thuguhte nang ahing ensah ding a, aziehpen theina in thuo tampi anei hi. Tuaziehin, Pasian in na thulimlouna sanga, tawmzaw ahing phut ahi, chi thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Suithawin Pasian thugil na muzou ding amah? Hoibukimna in Bangkimbawltheipa, na mu thei diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuakhu Van sanga sangzaw ahi a, bang na law diei? Hankhuh thuhte sanga thuhzaw ahi a, bang na chi theikhiet diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atena khu leitung sangin a sau zaw a, tualeh tuipi sanga lienzaw ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama peisuohta henlen, suongkul ah hing khum henlen, thukhen na ah hing hankhawm taleh, koi ahiei ama dal ngam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen aman mi mannabei athei a, aman gitlouna zong amu hi, tuachi’n Aman angaituo sih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gam sabiltungnou mihing banga, apien chiengin mibanglouten zong, theisiemna aneita ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Na lungtang na bawlhoi a, ama lam a na khut na zah leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na khuta thulimlouna aum leh koimang inlen, Na puon inn sungah gitlouna um nawn sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n gensietbei in, na mai na dahdoh sah ngamta ding a, tuachi’n na dingdet dinga, na zau sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na gentheina na manghilta dinga, tui luongmangsa bangin na theizingta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh na hinna khu suntang lai sangin, ataangphazaw dinga, a mielna zong zingkhovah abangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tualeh lam etna aum ziehin, na lungmuong ta ding a, kepbit in na um dinga, hamuong tahin na khawldamta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na lumsuh dinga, koiman nang ahing zausah nawnsih ding hi, tuachi’n mi tampiten na deisahna asui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanleh mi giloute mit khu mawhna ahita dinga, asuohta sih ding ua, tualeh a kinepna u’zong anah tawpna uh ahi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in a dawnga, tambangin a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ginlahuoilou mite na hi ua, tualeh noute toh pilna ashi khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh noute mabangin theisiemna ka nei a, noute sangin ka ngiem zaw tuom sih hi. Tambang silte koiin atheimaw talawm diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keipen ka lawm leh guolte nuiha-buohna, ka hita a, Pasian ka han a, Aman ahing dawng hi, mi dih leh gensietbei, mite simmaw leh nuisat a umpa ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nuomtah a umten vangsietna kichi khu, ketot teute tan dinga guot sa ahi, a chi ua a simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Suomhatte puonbuh khu alawchinga, Pasian sulungthahte abit uhi; tuate khu a pasien uh akhut ua tawite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hinanleh tuin sate va dong lachin, ahing hil ding uhi, tunga leeng vate zong dong lachin, ahing hil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitunga hampa poute dong lachin, ahing sinsah ding ua, tualeh, tuipi a nga ten na kungah aphuongkhe ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tamte zousie lah a koi pen in ahiei, Mangpa khut in tami abawl ahi, chi theilou ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama khut ah sil hing chinteng hinna leh, mihing zousie nahna zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bil in thute azahchien bangin, kam in ann achiem sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Teehsete lah ah pilna a um a, damsawtna ah theisiemna a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“A kungah pilna leh hatna a um a, aman lemguotna leh theisiemna anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aman asuhsiet leh koiman alamtha thei sih a, aman mi kot akhakhum leh, koiman ahong zou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aman tuite atuhtang leh akang mai hi, aman tuite ahaa chiengin, leitungah tuisang alet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama kungah thahatna leh pilna a um a, sol a umpa leh a solpa zong, Ama a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman lemguot mite lawsam in apuimanga, thukhen mite amawsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lengte kolbu asut pieh a; akawng uah puon in agah pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman siempute lawsam in apuimanga, mihatte anuoikieh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi muonhuoi thugente zong alamanga, upate sie leh pha khensiem theina zong alamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leng tapate tungah simmawna abuohkhum a, mihatte kawnggah zong asut pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman miel sa tah a sil kiphuolte akilangsah a, shina lim zong khovah asuoh sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman namte thupitahin abawl a asumang zel hi. Aman namte a sulien a, athezah zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aman leitung lamkaite pilna alahmang pieh a, lampi umlouna gamdai ah avahthap sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vah umlouin miel lah ah akimaimaw ua, tualeh zukham bangin ahawilen sah kawi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Envawi, Ka mit in tamte zousie amuta a, Ka bil in zong azata a atheisiemta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na thei bangbang un ken zong ka thei a, noute sangin ka ngiemzaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinanleh Bangkimbawltheipa ka houpi ding a, tualeh Pasian toh ka tungtang thu, ngaituo khawm ka lunggul zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noutepen zuou phuote na hi ua, na bawn un pannabei daktorte na hi bou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hamlou in sip khinkhian u’lachin, tua khu nou a dingin pilna hi zaw ma ding hiven maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuin ka thugente na ngai unlen, ka kam a ka ngetnate na ngaikhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasian a ding a giloutah a gen ding na hi uoi mah? Ama a ding a lepchietah a houlim ding na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama lamah deisah tuom na neina uh, sulang ding na hi uoi mah? Pasian a dinga pawngpan ding na hi u’maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman noute ahing sui-doh chiengin, nou a dingin a hoi na diei? Ahisihleh mi khat in mi dang khat, a sol bangin ama na sol ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simthama deisah tuom na nei pouma uleh, aman hing phawhhil ngei ngei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thupina in ahing zausah sih ding amah, tualeh azau huoina na tung uah, atusih ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na khanglui thupilte uh, vut bang lel a mannabei paunahte ahi a, Na kidalnate u’zong tungman kidalna bang giap ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Sip khinkhian un keiman thu hing gen vang, tua chiengin ka tungah atung nuom nuom tungta heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bangdinga ka tahsa ka ha a pet a, Ka hinna ka khut a koi ding ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />En vawi, Aman kei hing that hil hiel nanlezong, Ama ah ka lam etna ka koi nalai ding a, Amasangah ka lampite ka keem hoi nalai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama ka hundamna ahita dinga, milepchiete amasang ah ahing pei thei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thugen pilvang tah in ngaikhie unlen, tualeh ka thu phuondohte na bil un za heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai un, ka tungthu geelsa diemin ka koita a, Siem tansah a um ding ka hi chi ka theita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei hing kinielpi ding koi ahiei um? sip khinkhian in umta leng, shi mai ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka tungah sil ni bawlda phot inlen, tuachi’n nangma apat in ka kiphuol sih ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />kei akipat gamlapi ah na khut ladoh inlen, tualeh na zauhuoina in, kei hing zausah nawn sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuachi’n hing han inlen, ka hing dawng dinga, ahisihleh, kang houpi dinga, nang nahing dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka thulimlouna leh ka khelnate, bangza a tam ahiei mah? Ka mawnate leh ka khelnate hing theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangdinga na mai na phuol a, na melma banga nang ngai ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nata hui mut leeng na gawtbe nalai ding amah? bupawl gawsa na nuadel ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangman kei demna dingin, sil khatah na giel a, ka khangdawnlai thulimlounate nangawn, na hing luosahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka kengte kol na bunsah a, ka lampite zousie vengin na kaihit a, Ka kephangte totna dongin gamgi nang hun piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n sil muot bangin, mihing a muot manga, nget nehsiet puonsil bangin amangthang zel hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Numei apat a hing piengdoh, mihing damsung nite tom mama napi, lungkham buoina toh akidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama pape bangin ahing pahkhie a, avuoi gawp pai hi. Nihim bangin ataimanga, a um den sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuabang mi tungah mitphelou in na ensaal in, thukhenna ah nangma toh na hing zawpi ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koi in ahiei sil nieh lah a kipat, asiengthou ladoh thei ding? Koiman la theisih va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing damsung nite guotsa ahi a, ha bangza dam ding ahiei, chi nangman na theisa ahi a, akaan theilou dingun gamgi na hun pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kilawmi banga ani nuomtah a azah bukim masangsie a, akhawldam theina dingin, kiheimangsan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aziehpen singkung ah kinepna a um a, kiphua nanleh zong, ahing mengtha kia ding a, a dawn suong kia ve ve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahuite leinuoi ah teh gawp nanleh, akungpi zong lei lah ah shi nanlezong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi pumin zong tui nom zieh in, ahing mengdoh kia dinga, singtuoite bangin abate, ahing zamdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh mihingte a shi a, ngiemtah a siel in a um a, mihingte hinna abei chiengin, amauh hei ah a umta uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuipi akipat tuite, tuihu a alenmang bangin, tualeh lui tuite akiema akan gaw bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuabang main mihingte zong alumsuh ua, athou kia nawn sih uhi; Vante aum nawnlou masangsie’n, akhanglou kia nawn sih ding uhi, ahisihleh a imutna ua pat phawhkia in, a um nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Oh! Sheol a hing phuol himai lachin, na lungthahna bei masang sie’n, hing na kemdenta mai lachin, kei a dingin hunbise khat hing guot pieh va chin, tuachi’n nang thei ngitngetta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihingte shitaleh ahing kia na diei? Ka sepgimna nite zousie a kipat a, ka kihenna hun atun dongin ka ngah den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangman na hing han dinga, ken ka hing dawng ding hi. Na khutsuoh na siemsate na lunggul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kalsuonte na sim ding a, ka khelnate na kaihit nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tatkhelnate ip sungah na khakhum a, ka thulimlounate na khuikhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Hinanleh muolte chim in akitawlmang dinga, suongpite zong amun ua pat in akiliamang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui in suongte atawmanga, hawhtui in leitang atawmang bangin, nangman mihingte lam etnate, na mangthangsah siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumtawn in ama tungah na guolzou a, apei zel a, amel na heng lamdanga, na sawlmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Atapate zatat in ahing um ua, tuakhu aman athei sih hi, suh ngiem in a um ua, hinanleh aman amauh ahilam athei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh atahsa tung ah natna anei ding a, tualeh asunga hinna hagau in asuun ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Teman mi Eliphaz in adawnga, tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipil in theina bangmalou toh adawng a, suolam hui in akigilvasah ding adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Houlimna phatuomlou toh angaituokhawm ding adiei? ahisihleh ahoi bangma bawl theilouna ding, thugen toh ageel ding adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi, zauna na paimanga, tualeh Pasian masang a thungetna na dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thulimlouna in na kam azilsah a, mi lepchiete thugen na tel zawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma kam ngel in ahing mawpai a, ken kang mawpai sih hi, na kam in nangma demna thu atheisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Nang mihing lah a pieng masa pen na hiei mah? Muolte um masanga pieng na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasian thuguh na zakha taimah? Pilna nanga dingbou nasa amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koute theilou nang bang ahiei na thei tuom? Koute theisiemlou, theisiemna bang ahiei na nei tuom?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Samkaangte leh putehte ka lah uah apang uhi, tuate na pa sanga upa zaw ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian henepnate, nanga dingin aneuseng taluo amah? Ahisihleh kam nem a thu kigente, na ia a zong namkhalou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangdinga na lungtang in, nang hing puimang ahiei mah? Bangding a na mitte phelap lap ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuabanga Pasian kal a, na lungsim na heimang a, tambang thute na kam a na pawtsah ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing bang ahia, khuchia asienthou thei ding? ahisihleh numei apat piengkhie koi ahiei, adihtat thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasian in a misiengthoute tung a, muonna akoingam sihleh, amitmu a vante nangawn asienthou sihleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thulimlouna tui dawn bang a dawn mihing, kidahhuoi leh nieh zaw sem hina va-ia unchie maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Na ngaikhie in, ka hing ensah ding, ka na mute, ka hing phuong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mipilten ana gensa uh, tualeh apu apate un zong ana imlou uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaute kung maimai a gam ana pieh laiin, alah uah gamdang mi koima avah kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Migilouin adamsung nite natna thuohgimna in amanga, mi nuoisie hat mi a dingin damsawtna phuolguhin a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zauhuoina thawm gingten a bil uh adim sah a, akiningchin laiin zong atungah, sugamtu ding atungah ahing tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mielna apat hing kile kia ding chi agingta sih a, tualeh namsau a tha ding ngah in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aneh ding suiin avah vai a, hei a um ahiei? achi hi. Mielna ni atung a hing tung pai ding ahi chi athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Buoina leh lungzinnaten ama uh azausah a, galdou dinga kisa leengpa bangin amauh azouthaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian dou dingin khuttum aleh ua, Bangkimbawltheipa douin aki-uongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A phaw laipawng sapi toh, ngamthaw tahin atungah atai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen amaite athauna in tuom a, a kawngte uh athau in dimsah nanleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />khopi tulsate ah ateng a, akilawisa leh chimsesa, koima luo nawnlou innte ah ateng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahausa sih ding a, anei leh lamte u’zong a umden sih ding hi, leitungah aneisate adimlet nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Miel apat in apawtdoh sih ding a, Ahing mengdohte zong meikuong in ahulgawp dinga, apallun laite zong hui in asemmangta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangmalou sil hawmguohpi muongin, ama leh ama kisol sih heh aziehpen, bangmalou khu akipahman ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama hun chin masang nangawn in, kimtah a bawlzou sieng ahi ding a, abazamte ahing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aman grep gui a aga min nailoute athingkhe dinga, Olive singkung bangin apahlunte khu apulsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aziehpen milepchiete kipawl khawmna ahawm guoh ahi a, nehguh chiingte puonbuh zong meiin akatum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amaun lungkham buoina naupai in apai ua, sietna ahing doh uhi, alungsimte un lepchiena ngen angai tuo uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawnga. Tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tambang sil tampi ka zata hi, na unpi un mi lung buoisah, henemtu ngen na hibou uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuginalou na gente un, tawp ni nei theilou ding ahiei mah? Ahisihleh bang thuohla nei a, ham hangsan na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei din mun a dingkha hi ulachin, kei zong noute kalin, thu gen thei sam ding hi veng in maw! tualeh ka lu ka hing thinkhum thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka kamsuohin noute ka hing suhat ding a, tualeh ka hamuonna kam in noute, gimthuohna ka hing henem ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Thu gen nanleng zong, ka lunggimna henepin aum tuom sih a, thuoh tei tei nanleng bang ahiei, nop ka sah tuon na?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin Pasian in ahing sugim gawpta a, ka khan leh guolten zong na hing taisan sah siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh na ahing vuoigawp sah a, tuami kei demna theipitu in apang hi, tualeh ka gawng suh deu deu a, tua khu ka maitangah theipitu in apang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman a thangpaina in ahing bottel a, ahing muda hi, aha ahing gawtkhuma, ka melma in kei dounain amit ataat hiem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amaun akam uh angna kahkhum ua, simmawhuoi tahin ka pheta ahing beh pieh ua, keima hing dou dingin akithutuoh ua, apangkhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian in migiloute khut sungah eina pekhie a, Pasian theiloute khut se nan ei neita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nopsataha ka umlai in Ama’n phalni ahing suo a, ka ngawngpengah ahing man a, ahing thing neen a, tualeh amelchina dingin ahing tungdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thalkap miten ka kimkot ah ahing im chimit ua, lainatnabei in ka lungtang akappailet ua; ka sinkhatui zong tuol ah abuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sietna tungah sietna ahing thuoh sah sawn sawn a, galhatpa bawl bangin ahing tuonchil gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka vun tuomna dingin la ip puon ka khui a, ka hatna khu leivui lah ah ka lumsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka kaa kaa nain ka mai amiel gawpta a, ka mitvunte ah shina limliep a um hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuachi pum in ka khut in silsie abawl sih a, ka thungetna zong asiengthou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Aw leisiet ka sisan khukhum sinlen, Ka kaanain zong khawldamna mu ngaisih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tulai tah ngel in kei hing theipipa vantungah a um a, Kei hing genpiehpa tunglam sangpi ah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka lawmten ahing simmaw ua, Ken Pasian mai ah ka hitui ka sungbuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihingin a innvengte a dinga anget pieh bangin, Pasian toh mihing kaal a genpieh ding umleh maw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen, kum tamlou khat ahing beichiengin, kinuale nawnlouna lampi ah ka peita ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hagau akehgawpta a, ka damsung nite atomta a, hante kei a dingin mansain a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hing simmawten hing imkhum uh hitalou ahiei mah? athangpaina uah ka mit aumden sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Tuin thuchiem khat Nangma toh kei a dingin, ka tungah koi inlen, kei a dinga mawpo ding koi ahiei um?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Theisiemna akipat alungtangte uh na phuol piehta a, tuaziehin amauh na pahtawi sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi’n nuomman deina zieh a akhanguolpa alebawl leh, atate mit nangawn lawsam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Aman mite houlimna paunah in ahing bawl a, tualeh keipen, maitanga mite chilphit khum ahing hisahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lunggimna ziehin ka mitte amiel gawpta, ka tahsa hiengte zousie zong nihim bang ahita uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Midihten tami muin lamdang asa ua, mawnaneilou miten zong, milepchiete douin akithathousah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinapiin, midihtatten alampite uh atudet ding ua, khut siengthou nei mi khu ahat sem sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanlezong noute na bawn un, hing nua pei kia un, aziehpen noute lah ah mipil khat zong ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nite a beita a, kalungsim a ka tup zousiete leh, ka lunggulteng akisegawp siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amauten zanlai khu sunlai asuohsah ua, khovah in khomiel ahing naita, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngah taleng han khu ka inn ahi a, miel lah ah, ka lupna ka pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Muotna kungah, nang ka pa nahi ka chi a, thante kungah nang ka nu ahisihleh, ka sanggam nu na hi, chi kawita leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka lam etna hei a um hita ding adiei? Koi in ka lam etna a mutheita diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua lam etna khu shina kotgawlte a lut suh ding adiei? Leivui lah a ikhawlkhawm ta ding uoi leh?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shuhmi Bildad in adawnga, tam bangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangtan vei thu sui sui ding na hiei mah? Kingaituo in, tuachi’n kouten ka gen ding uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangdinga koute na mitmu a, gamsa banga na hing ngaisut a, mi mote banga na hing bawl ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungthah laitah a nangma leh, nangma ki-ehmalpa aw, nang zieh a leitung nuasie a um ding ahiei mah? ahisihleh suongpite a umna mun uapat, kiliamang ding ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ahi, migilou meivah akimutmit a, ameikuong zong a taang nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Apuonbuh sung a vah zong amiel a, atung a thaumei zong amielta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahatna akalsuonte zong tomsah ahita a, alemguotnate un amauh asawn pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen amauh keng ngei in len sungah apailut a, tualeh thang tungah aviel vah kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thangah aketul a awh a, thanggui in ama atudenta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama dingin thangkhau lei lah ah akiphuol a, alampi ah gathang akikam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ningchin ah zauna in ama achiza sah a, azanung ah adel zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hatna gilkielna in anegam dinga, akipalpuana dingin vangsietna a gei ah mansa in aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Natnaten avun ane khawngta a, tamasapen shina in, akhut akeng anekhawngta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A muonna khu puonbuh apat bawdoh in a umta a, azauhuoi mama leengpa kungah atun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama a hilou puon inn sungah ateng ding ua, atenna inn tung uah, kat akithe zah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Athahuite zong leinuoi ah agaw gawpta a, atung lam ah abazamte avuoi siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amauh thei zingna khu leitung apat amang ding a, kholai dungah amin uh a umkha nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amauh vah akipat miel lah a delmang in a um ding a, leitung apat nawmangin a umta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaun amite lah uah tapa anei sih ding ua, tupa zong anei sih ding a; atena mun ua teng ding mi aum nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tumlam gam miten adam sung nite uh, lamdang asa ma ma uh a, Suolam mite zong lamdangsa sengin a chiza vawt uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adihtahin migiloute tenna khu tambang mawng ahia, Pasian thei khaloute mun leh muol tambang ngenma ana hi leng hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawng a. Tambangin agen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangtan vei ahiei ka hinnain na thuohgimsah ding ua, thu a nang suhguoi dildel ding uh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tambangin sawm vei tah nang houseta ua, kei dihlouna ahi; nang chi uh zumlou na hi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suhkhiel na neitama nanleng zong, ka suhkhelna keima ah a um zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima kal a kiliensah na hitaah u’leh, ka minsietna ka tungah gen ma un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian in dihlou ahing tangsah a, tualeh aleen in ahing tun ahi, chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawngbawl a mawtansah ka hi chiin ka kikou a, ahing ki dawng sih hi. Ngaitah in ka kikou a, hinanleh thudih a thukhenna a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman ka pei theilouna dingin ka lampi, daiin a im a, tualeh ka peina lampi ah miel akoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei akipat ka thupina ahawhkhie a, Ka lutunga pat, Manglukhu alakhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman ningchin ah ahing susie a, amangthang ka hita, ka ki nepna zong singbul kal bangin akalkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Alungthahna ka tungah akuongsah nalai a, amelmate lah a khat in ahing simtel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Agalkap honte ahing kikhawm ua, Kei dou dingin ahing kuon ua, Ka puon inn kimkot in panmun akhaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Aman ka unaute kei a kipat, gamlapi ah ahing koi pieh a, tualeh ka meltheite zousie, kei apat in azintangsahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hieng ka sante’n ahing nuasieta ua, ka lawm hoiten ahing manghilta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka inn a tengte leh ka suoh numeiten, mituom in ahing ngaita ua, amitmu uah meltheilou gamdang mi ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka suohpa ka han a, ahing dawngta sih a, kamdam in ama ka zawl teitei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka zi adingin ka nahhu anamsie a, ka tahsa mama ka tate adingin thet huoitah ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Naupang neute nangawn in ahing simmaw ua, ka thaw chiengin kei kal in thu agen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka khanguol ngaite zousie in zong, ahing kidah siengta ua, Ka it leh ngaite nangawn in, kei ma douin alangpangta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka gute khu ka vun leh ka tahsa ah abeh chinten a, tualeh ka ha avun toh ka suohtasah ham ham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nou ka lawmte aw, hing khotuo un, hing khotuo un, aziehpen Pasian khut in ahing thamkhata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangdinga Pasian hing suhgenthei banga, nouten na hing suhgenthei uh ahiei mah? Ka tahsa thuohgimna a, lungkim zoulou na hi nalai uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Ka thute gelkhieh himai leh aw! tuate khu laibu a kigiel hita mai leh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Suongpi tungah siazum leh ngen in, kumtawna ngamden dingin ki giel leh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aziehpen, kei hing tanpa ahing chi ka thei, ni nukhia chiengin, leitungah ading ding chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka vunte suhsiet a aum nuachiengin, ka tahsa mama in Pasian ka mu ding, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima mamain, ka mu dinga, Keima mitngel in midang hilou, Ama ka en ding a, ka sunga ka lungtangin alunggul pen khu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama bang ichi suhgenthei ding uoi, na chi uleh sil bulte keima ah mu in aum chi thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Namsau giing un, thangpainain namsau a gawtnate tun ding ahi, tuazou chiengin, thukhenna um ding ahi,” chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Naamath mi Zophar in adawng a. Tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuaziehin ka ngaituonate in kei dawnna ahing pie a, tami ziehin ka kinaw ahi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima hing kizumsuona leh, hing kigendaina khu ka za hi. Tualeh ka theisiemna hagau in, ahing dawng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tanglai leitung a mihing akikoi chiil a kipat a, tam sil na um ahita chi na thei sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Migiloute kitawisangna tomnou kaal ahi giap a, Pasian neiloute kipahna khu, mitphietkaal bep ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Athupina in vante suntouin, alutang in meipite phatou nanleh zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaute eeh bangin amangthai ding ua, Amauh na mukhaten, Hei a um ata uoi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zanmang bangin a leengmang ding ua, akimu nawnta sih ding uhi, Zanlai mengmuna bangin, akidelmang ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amauh na mu ngai mitten, a nua mu nawn sih ding ua, a umna mun in zong ama a en nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ataten mi zawngte deisahna asui ding ua, akhutte un anei alamte uh, anua pieh kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Akhanglai thahatna a dim agute khu, ama toh leivui lah ah a lum khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A kam uah gitlounate hum sa in, alei nuoi uah phuolnan ule zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />agenkhiet ding uh ut vawtlou in, akam sung uah imden sawm nan uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />agilsunga ante khu akikhule dinga, asungah gul gukha ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amaun hausatna anawmval ua, tuami mama alawkhe kia zel ua, Pasian in agil ua pat apaidoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gulngan gute atawp ding ua, muoltan lei in amauh athat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amaun lui te, lui liente khuoizu leh, Bawngnawidat lui a luongte, lungngul in a mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asepgimna ga anua pieh kia ding ua, tualeh asummet bawlna ua pat a, amette zong aval tumsuh nawn sih ding ua, nuomsa tahin aum sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aziehpen amaun migentheite anuoisie ua, tualeh ataisan uhi, tualeh amauh lamlou inn apawng lahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Adihtah in alungtang sung uah muonna mawngmawng athei sih ding ua, atuppente uh akhol tuom sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aneh zou nua un avaal bangma a um sih ding a, tuaziehin anopsahna un sawt adai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Akiningchin sanlaitah un, vangsietna atuoh ding ua, gentheina chinteng atung uah, atung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Agilpi vasah dinga akisah lai in, Pasian in alungthahna zauhuoitah, atung uah atungsah dinga aneh laitah un, atung uah guo bangin azusah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sia galvan akipat ataidoh dinga, sum-eng thalpi in asun pailet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua khu adohkhie a, atahsa apat ahing pawtdoh a, asinkha ua pat thaltang tesetset apawtdoh a, zauhuoina atung uah atung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miel satah khu agou kholkhawm uh ahi a, koima semlou mei in amauh akatum dinga, puonbuh a kinuasiete nangawn, akamang sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vanten athulimlouna uh asulang ding a, leitung ama dou ding in akisa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A inn ua asil pungte uh lahmangin a um dinga, Pasian thangpaina ni ah anei alamte uh, aluongmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tami khu Pasian apata, migiloute tanvou ahi a, Agouluo ding ua Pasian in aguotpieh khu ahita hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawnga, tambangin agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka thugen khu pilvangtah in na ngaikhie unlen, tami na henepna thu uh hita hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hing thuohpi ham ham unlen, thu kang gen ding hi; ka genzou chiengin hing enghou nava u’teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka phunnate mihing tunga phun a nei gen uh ahiei mah? Bangzieh a dawtheilou tah a, umlou ding ka hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei hing en un, na chi uh aza ding hi, na khut un na kam uh hum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami ka ngaisut khah chiengin, ka chiza senga, zau in ka chi akithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangchidan a, migiloute hing ua, ahing upa ua, vanglien tah a, thunei sem sem uh adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahah asuonte uh amitmu uah, amautoh suhkip in a um ua, amitmu ngel ua ata uh suhkip a um amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A innte u’zong, zauhuoina lah ah agalmuong a, Pasian chiengpum zong atung uah atukha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abawngtalte un chi ha louin alawsam ngai sih ua, abawngpite un nou anei ua, anau se ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atate uh belam hon bangin avah khawm sah ua, ataneute uh alam va liei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pehging leh gawsem thuo in la asa ua, atheile tumging uah aguolnuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adamsung nite uh nei leh lam toh azang ua, hamuong tahin, hankhuh a zuon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanleh a mauten Pasian kungah, koute hing nuasie in, na lampite theinuom in ka lunggul sih uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bangkimbawlthei koi ahia, ana ka seppieh ding uh ahiei? Ama kunga ka thunget zieh ua, bang metna ahiei ka mu ding uh? a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanleh a nopsahnate uh amauh khut a um ahisih a, tuaziehin migiloute lemguotna khu kei a pat in agamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Migiloute meivah khu mit mun hina e! atung uah vangsietna tung mun hina e! Pasian lungthahna in, atung uah lunggimna ape chiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama u’khu hui masanga bupawl bang leh, huipi mai a bushi mut mang bang ahi uhi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian in athulimlounate uh, atate ua dinga ana koikhawm pieh ahi, aman athuh a, tualeh athei hi achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amit mama un asietna uh mu u’henlen, bangkimbawltheipa thangpaina khu dawn uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aziehpen ama ua dinga kiguotsa, adamsung ha te uh sattan ahi nua chiengin, anuasie sa a innkuonte uh, khuolna bang anei nawn ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi’n Pasian kungah pilna ahil thei diei? tunglam sangtah a umte zong, aman thukhenna abawlpieh ahi, chi thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi khat ahat laitah leh a nopsah laitahin ashi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Atahsa nawitui in adim a, tualeh, agute khu chintuigu in anou sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midangte lah hinkhuo gentheitah leh, kipahtah a ann tuitah chiemkhalouin, ashi zel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Akibangin leivui lah ah a lumkhawm ua, thanten atuom tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, ka tunga dihlou tah a, na ngaituona lunggelte ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aziehpen, nangman, milien milalte inn heisunga um ahiei? tualeh migiloute tenna puon inn, heisunga um ahiei? na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Lamlien apei khuolzin mite nadong kha ngaisih amah? achiemtenate uh nathei sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Migiloute khu vangsiet ni chieng a dingin khawi in a um ua, lungthah ni chiengin puidohin a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Koi ahiei aumdan uh amaitanga hil ngam ding? Koi ahiei a sil bawlte thuh ngam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hankhuh zuon a akizawn chiengin, ahan khu ven in a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama dingin guom a leitangte a hum dinga, michin in anua azui ding ua, amasanga peite sim senglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuachi’n bangchidan a, aphatuomlou thute a kei hing hamuon na hi uoi? bangchi hamuon sawm nahi uoi mah? Na hing dawnnate uah zuouthu chilou,” bangma aum sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Teman mi Eliphaz in a dawnga, tambang in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Mipil ama a dinga aphattuom mabangin, mihing Pasian a dingin aphatuom thei diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma dihtat talechin, bangkimbawltheipa kipahna khat ahi diei le? ahisihleh na lampite dembei in koita lachin, ama a dingin punna ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama na giinna ziehin, nang hing phoh hil ding ahiei mah? tualeh ama nang toh thukhenna ah a lut diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na gitlouna alien hilou amah? tualeh na thulimlouna tawp neilou ahisih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen bangmaloupiin, na unau a pat khaamna na la ua, apuonte uh na hawhkhie ua saguohin na koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi gim leh tawlte kungah dawn ding tui na pe sih a, tualeh gilkielte a dingin na tanghou na it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh mihat in gam anei a, mi zatat huoi khunah ateng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Meithaite khut guohin na sawlmanga, tualeh pa neiloute ban zong na hehlawi piehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin na kimvel ah thangte akikam a, tualeh thakhata zauna in nang ahing buoisah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahisihleh, na mutheilou na dingin ahing miel a, tui tampi in nangma ahing tum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Vantung sang ah Pasian a um sih amah? aasi sangpente san dan en in, bangzata a sang ahita uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaziehin nangman Pasian in bang achi thei ahiei? Tuabang miel sapi lah ah thu akhen thei diei mah? na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meilum satah in ama tuomkhum a, tuachi’n aman amu thei sih hi, tualeh van kikuol tungah avah kawi kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilouten ana zuisa lampi lui khu, zui nalai ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaute ahun uh chin masangin, lahmangin a um ua, akingapna uh suongphumte nasan uh, tui sanglet in ataimangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amauten Pasian kungah koute hing taisan in, Bangkimbawltheipa’n, amauh bang alaw zou diei mah? achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama’n a innte uh silhoi in asuhdim pieh nalai a, hinanleh migiloute lemguotna khu kei a kipat a gamla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midihtatten ana mu ua, akipah uhi; mawnaneilou miten a nuisan uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pellouin igalte uh sattan in umta uh a, tualeh a um sunteng zong mei in akatum siengta hi, a chi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tuin Pasian toh kilem inlen, hamuong tahin um in, tuachi’n silhoi in nang ahing zuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama kam a kipat thuhilna sang inlen, na lungtang ah athute kholkhawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkimbawltheipa kunga na kinuale leh, Aman ahing siemtha dinga, na puon innte apat in thulimlouna, na koimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na sanate leivui lah a na koi a, na ophir sanate luita suong lah a na koikhiet pouleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahi Bangkimbawltheipa khu na sana leh, na dangka manpha ahi ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n bangkimbawltheipa kungah, na kipahta dinga, Pasian kungah na mai nasangdah sahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama kungah thumna na nei ding a, aman aza ding hi. Tualeh nang na thuchiemte na tangtun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thupuasah khat na bawl dinga, tuakhu nanga dingin ahing suhdet pieh ding hi, tuachi’n na lampite vah in ahing salvahta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amauten nang ahing suhngiem chiengun, nang dindohna aum na chi ding hi, aziehpen ama’n kingaingiemte ahundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Aman mawna nei lou mite nangawn zong ahundam dinga, Ahi na khut sienthouna zieh in amaute a suohta ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawnga, tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tuni tandongin ka phunnate a nasa deu deu a, ka thuohna ka mauna sangin agih zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ka muna ding mun theita maleng aw, ama touna mun a va pei thei hitama leng aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thute amasangah lui vangin, ka kam kinielna in ka dimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama hing dawnna ding, ka theikhe ding a, ka kunga agen ding ka theisiemta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A silbawltheina thupitahin, Aman kei ahing kinielpi nuom diei izaw? niel nuomlou e, Aman kei ahing ngaisah zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khunah midihin ama toh ava kikum thei ding ua, tuachi’n keima thu hing khenpiehpa apat in, hutkhiet ka hidenta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“En vawi mailam ah ka pei a, Ama khunah ana um sih a, nualam a ka pei zel a hinanleh, ama ka mu tuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Veilam panga nna aseplai in ka mu thei sih a, zietlangah akihei a ama ka mu thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh aman ka lampi zui athei a, Aman kei ahing ze et zou chiengin, sana bang maiin ka hing suohdoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kengin aketotna nua ka zui zinga, alampite ka zui a, ka pielsan vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Akam a thupiehte akipat in ka pielmang sih a, akam a a thupawtte khu gou bangin kana kikhol zaw a, ka nisim annneh sangin manpha kasa zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanleh Ama khu lungtang henglou ahia, Koi ahiei Ama kiheisah thei ding? Aman a ut bangbangin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei a dinga aguotte a tangtung sah zel hi, tualeh hichibang sil tamtah akungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama mai ah ka zau a, ka ngaituo chiengin Ama ka giing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasian in ka lungtang aba sah a, Bangkimbawltheipa’n ahing zausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen khomiel lah a kipat in, satkhieh in kana um sih a, khomiel satahin ka mai akhu khum sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Bangzieh a Bangkimbawltheipa apat a, hunte phuolguh a aum thei a, bangdinga ama theiten a nite khu mu lou ahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi kimkhatten gamgi asuon ua, tualeh pautatin belam honte agu ua, akikhawita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tagate sabiltung adelmang pieh ua, thuchiemna dingin meithaite bawngtal alahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mitasamte lam gei ah a sawnkhie ua, leitunga migentheite akiphuolmang sahta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Envawi, gamgaw gam a sabiltungte bangin, mizawngten ann neh ding a sui ua, semgim in akuondoh uhi; tualeh hawlou gamdaiin atate ua dingin, anneh ding apiengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Neh ding ann loulai ah akhawm kawi ua, migiloute grep huon ah asang asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zan tungtawn in puon sillou in saguohin alum khovah ua, khovot a silding bangma anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muol leh taang a guomalphinte’n amauh apahsah a, belding neilou in suongpi akawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pa neilou naungeh nawitep laite asatkhie ua, tualeh mi zawngte ta ngehlaite, leiba ditna dinga kichiemna dingin alahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi zawngte puon sillouin saguohin akawivah sah ua, gilkielte akipat in, buphaite alahpieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun a huongsungte uah Olive thau asuh ua, a uoin suhna uh a chil ua, dangtah athuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi shikuonte khopi sungah atau ua, aliemte hinna akikoukhie a, hinanleh Pasian in amauh adon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Khovah dou a helte zong a um ua, amaun khovah lampite athei sih ua, alampite zong azui sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualthat mite khovah philphiel in athou ua, mi zawngte leh tasamte athat ua, zanlai chiengin guta bangin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aangkawmpa mit in zong khomui angah a, koiman hing musihva chiin amai asiem lamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khomiel chiengin sunlai a achiemtesa uh, innte avutpailet ua khovah athei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen ama ua ding in zingmawng zong, shina limliep bang ahi a, mi’n amauh theita u’leh, shina limliep zauhuoi a um ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Amaute tuitungah gangtah a tawlmangin aum ua, Leitunga atanvou uh hamsiet ahi a, agrep huonte uah koima apei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khokhal nisa leh kholum in vuate azunmangsah bangin, hankhuhin mikhielte alamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Naubuin amauh amanghilding a, thanten amauh kivahnan anei ding uhi; amaute theikhah ahinawn sih ding ua, gitlouna khu sing bangin atawngsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Amaun taneilou numei chiingte kivah nan anei ua, meithaite tungah silhoi abawl sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in mihat khu asilbawltheina in a hiip a, athoudoh a koima’n ahinna thu atheichien sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aman amaute bitna apie a, tualeh tuanah akhawl uhi, hinanleh amit in agamtatnate uh a en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hun tomnou sung tawisang in a um ua, abeimangta uhi tuachi’n suhngiem in a um ua, Midang zousie bangin, lampi apat lahmangin a um ua, buvui banga attan in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabang hilou hitaleh, koi ahiei kei mizuou a hing bawl ding? Tualeh ka thugente zong bangmalou asuoh sah ding?” a chi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shuh mi Bildad in adawnga akungah tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Vaihawmna leh zauna Pasian kungah a um a, Aman van sangte ah lemna abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Agalkapte simseng guol ahi uoi mah? tualeh koi tungah ahiei avah asuolou.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi ahileh Pasian masangah, mihing bangchin asiemtang thei diei? Ahisihleh numei apata pieng bangchi sien thei ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai vawi, hapi nangawn atangpha sih a, aasite zong ama mitmu ah asieng sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuchi ahitaahleh lungnou bang giap mihingte, bangchituh a sienglou zaw sem ding ata diei? Tualeh mihing tapa lah talteng bang giap ahi bou hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in adawnga, tambang in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Silbawltheina neiloupa nah panpi nalaizang chie! bantha hatna neiloupa bangchi dan a na hundam kawi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna neilou ama bangding a thu na mop laizang ahiei? bangding a thumopna hoi tampi na hil kawi laizang ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Koi kungah ahiei thute na gen khiet? Koi pen hagau ahiei nangma akipat a hing pawtdoh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tui nuoi a um mishite leh, khuna tengte zousie lungdongin achitun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian masangah hankhuh guohtang ahi a, sietna zong akhuna neilou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman mallam khu mun awng tungah apha a, leitung khu bangmalou tungah akhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aman ameilum satah sungah tuite a kaankhawm a, hinanleh tuiten anuoilam a meilumte aphukeh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman halia lai maitang akhu khum a, atungah meilum azah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman tui tungah chiemtena agitkuol a, tuakhu vah leh miel kikaal a gamgi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasian in aphawh hilna zau in van khuomte akiling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A silbawltheina in tuipi ahot a, atheisiemna in Rahab a asatgawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anah hu in vante a zemhoi a, akhut in gulpi lenglai asun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En vawi, tamte zousie anasepte lah a, athem nengkhat ahi bou hi, i bilkawm a ahing houpi ina zahte, ngat hina hiu hiau e, hinanleh asilbawltheina, vanpi ging koi ahiei theisiem ding?”
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job in athugente agenzomtou nalai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka dihna lamang Pasian leh, ka hinna khatah mai hing chiemsah, Bangkimbawltheipa hinna siel in ka gen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka sunga hinna hu a um laisie, ka nahkuo hawmte a Pasian hu a um lai siein;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka kam in thudihlou agen sih dinga, ka lei in solna thu agen sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na dih hi, ka hing chi ngaisih ding a, ka shi masangsie’n ka ginumna kei a kipat, ka koimang vawt sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka dihtatna ka kemden dinga, ka hasuo ngai sih ding hi, ka damsung siein, ka lungtangin ahing phawh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka melmate migiloute bang uhenlen, kei hing doute mi dihtatloute bang uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Punna tampi mu nan uleh, Pasian in ahinna uh alahmang chiengin milepchie dingin bang kinepna aum diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atung ua buoina ahing tun chiengin, Pasian in akikouna uh aza diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauh Bangkimbawltheipa tungah akipah ding uoi? Hun chinteng in Pasian ahan na ding uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ken Pasian khut tungtang nou ka hing hil dinga, Bangkimbawltheipa toh umkhawm silte, phuolguh ka nei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Adihtah in na bawnun tami na mu chietta ua; bangchi dan a hichibanga bangmalou, hing suoh sieng na hi ta uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tua khu Pasian akipata amu ding uh tanvou khu ahia, Bangkimbawltheipa akipat a, mi nuoisiete gouluo ding khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Atate uh apun uleh zong namsau a ding ahia, tualeh ahah asuonte uh tanghou in atai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anua ua dam nalaite zong natpi in avui ding ua, ameithaite un amaute suunlou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amaun dangkasiate leivui bangin sievumin, nihten puonsil tungvum bangsah nan uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aman a khol khawm thei a, hinanleh midihtatten asil ding ua, mawna neilou miten adangkate uh akihawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A inn lamte u’zong lungbu bang bep ahia, grep huon vengmi sawlbuh bang bep ahi bou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi hausa alum ding a, hinanleh khopkhawm in a um sih ding hi, amit ahah a, a umta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuisang let bangin a mauh zauna in aman a, huipi in amauh zan kaal in atawmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Suolam hui in amauh atawmang a, apeimangta uhi. A aumna mun ua pat amutmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lungsietna bei in hui in alumle dinga, huipi thahatna zieh in, lu bungbuin aleeng mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Miten amauh simmawin akhut uh abeh khum ding ua, amun ua pat amutmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Adihtahin dangka ki tawdohna khuh a um a, sana suhsiengna mun zong a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei akipat in sia akitoudoh a, tualeh suong akipat in dan akisung khie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihingten mielna abei sah ua, mun gamla pente leh, miel nasatah leh shina lim guom a suongte zong asui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing tenna akipat gamlapi ah, lei khuh atou ua, mihing kengin atotkhahlouna munte atou suh ua, mite akipat gamla tah ah akikhai khe suh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitung khu neh ding ann hing pienna ahi a, hinanleh asung khu mei ahi mabangin a kilumlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuami suongpite khu Saphire suongmantamte ahing kilah khietna ahia, tuate’n sana vui a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuami lampi khu sa sielne vaten athei sih ua, langtate mitin zong amu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Humpibahnei kisatheiten zong atuonkha ngai sih ua, humpibahnei giinhuoi te zong apei kha ngai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Amaun meisa suongpi tungah akhut uh akoi ua, taangte azung tandongin alumlet uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Suongpite lah ah tuilamte atoudoh ua, amit un sil manpha chi-chin amu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luongkhe-sahlou keiin luinahte achingtan ua, sil kiphuolte vah ah alakhie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Hinanleh pilna hei sungah akimu thei diei? tualeh theisiemna khu hei sunga um adiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing in pilna manphatna atheikhe zou sih a, mihing gam ah mu ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tui thuhpi in kei sungah a um sih, achi a, tuipi in kei kungah a um sih achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pilna khu sana hoipenin zong akilei thei sih a, aman zong dangka toh kibuh theilou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ophir sana toh zong amanphat dan akite thei sih a, Onix suongmantam ahiei, Saphire suongmantam ahiei toh zong kite theilou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pilna manphat dan pen, sana leh suongval in zong atuhzou sih a, sana siengthou toh zong akiheng thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Koral suongmanpha leh Jasper suongmanphate gentaah ahisih a, pilna man in Rubi suongmantamte a khup hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ethiopia gam a Topaz toh te guol ahisih a, Sana sieng sitset toh zong tekah guol hilou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Tuachibang ahileh, pilna hei a pat a hing umdoh ata diei le? theisiemna mun zong heisung ata diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Silhing chinteng mitmu ah akiphuol a, vanlai zawl a vate mitmu apat nangawn in a kiphuol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sietna leh shina thuthang ka bil un kana zata uhi, achi ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Pasian in alampi atheisiem a, tualeh a umna mun zong athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aziehpen aman leitung tawpna aen suoh a, tualeh vannuoi pumpi a mu suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aman huipi kung ah gihna apie a, tualeh tuite tenain ate-tuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aman guo a dingin thupieh abawl lai in, vanging leh tunphe adinga lampi abawl pieh lai in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman pilna amuta a, tualeh aphuongdohta a, Aman tuami abawlkhola, asuikhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tualeh aman mihing kungah, Pasian giin khu pilna dihtah ahia, sil hoilou kiheimangsan khu theisiemna ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Job in athugen ban agen zom nalai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Aw nidanglai ha beisate a, Pasian in ahing ven lai bangin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A meivah ka lutunga ataan lai a, Ama vah a, miel lah a ka pei lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khangdawng lutlai nite a ka um bangin, Pasian toh kilawm hoi hina, athuguh ka puon inntunga a um lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangkimbawltheipa kei toh a um khawm lai in, ka tate ka kimvel a, a um lai un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kalsuonte nawitui dat a sawp ahi lai in, kei dinga suongpi in sathau luite aluon sah lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khopi kulkotpi a ka pawtdoh lai a, mipi kikhopna mun a ka tou lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tangvalten ahing mu ua akiphuol ua, upate zong adingtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lengtapate houlimlai akhawl ua, tualeh akam uh akhut un ahum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Miliente aw asip dide a, tualeh alei uh adangtawng uah abeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bil in azah chiengin hampha angchi ua, mit in ahing mu chiengin theipina ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen mi zawng leh pa neilou panpi ding neilou a, kikoute ka hundoh zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangthai dinga mansa mite, guolzawlna ka tungah ahing tunga, meithai alungnop zieh a, lasa dingin ka um sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dihtatna ka sil a tualeh ahing tuom hi, dihna khu ka puontuol leh ka diel khip ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mittaw a dingin mit ka hi a, Kengbai a dingin keng ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tasamte adingin pa ka hi a, ka meltheilou mite thubul zong ka suidoh pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi giloute khagu ka suhtan pieh a, akamsung ua kipat in asuh gentheite uh, ka loidoh pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka inn ah ka shi dinga, ka nite pieunel bangin ka pungsah ding, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka huiten tui lah ah zung ahasuh dinga, zankhovah in ka bazamte tungah daitui akai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thupina khu ka sung ah atha zel a, ka thalpi zong ka khut sungah, siemtha in a um zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Miten ka thugente lunglut tah in angaikhie ua, ka lemguotte dai dide in angah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka genzou chiengin agen kia nawn sih ua, ka thugente atung uah daitui bangin a umden hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amaun guotui ngah bangin ahing ngah ua, guotui nukhia ngah bangin akam uh akaah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amauh lam nga a ka nui mel chiengin, agingta ngam sih ua, ka melvah ah amauh alung kesih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A lampi uh ka telpieh a, amaute lamkaipa bangin ka tou a, agalkapte lah uah leengpa bangin ka um a, mishi suunte hamuonpa bangin ka um hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hinanleh tunvang kei sanga naupang zawten, nuihatangbuohna’n ahing neita ua, apate uh ka ganhon veng uite toh, koi dinga ka deiloute’n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaute bantha hat in kei a dingin, bang phattuomna anei ding adiei? ahatna uh beimangsa ten.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tahsapna leh gilkielna ziehin agawnggawp ua gamsie leh luolou, gamdai ah atailut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amaun pawn lah a loupa zung khate alou ua, munphekung huite ane uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mite lah a pat in delmangin a um ua, gutate akihawhkhum bang in, anua uah ahawhkhum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Guomkuoh kaal leh leikohawm lah leh, suongkawm lah a teng ding in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Singbawh lah ah a eu tehtuh ua, lingle khau nawng lah ah akilom sie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amauh mimaw tate ahi ua, miginalou tate ahi ua, gamsung apata delmang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Tuin keipen la el ahingphuo khum ua, alah uah kamthau hauna ka suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amauten ahing kidah ua, ka kung apat akikaangkoi ua, kisuongla lou keiin, ka maitang ang chilphit khum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in ka thalpi gui akolsah a, ahing sugentheita hi, Amaun ka mitmuin kamkaina aha kheta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka khut zietlam ah, migilou hon adingdoh ua, ka keng asawnmang ua, ka sietna ding lampite a siel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lampi asusie ua, ka vangsietna ding ngen asui ua, panpi ding mi anei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sietna awng kaal lienpi ah ahing lut ua, a sietna mun ah ahing kilia lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zauhuoinaten ahing tuom khum a, ka zatat huoinate huibangin anuadel ua, Ka nopsah nate meilum bangin akitawlmangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tualeh tuin ka sungah, ka hinna tuibanga sun buohin a um a, gimthuohna nite’n ahing mantangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zan chiengin ka gu ka tangten ahing chipa, ka natna in ahing ngietngiet ziehin, ka thahuite a khawldam thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka natna akhawhseng ziehin ka puonsil akihengta a, ka puonah ngawng bangin kei ahing gah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasian in buonnawi lah ah ahing pai lut a, tuachi’n leivui leh vut ka suohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma hanin ka kikou a, nang lah na hing dawng sih a, ka dingtou a, hinanleh khoh nasa sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka tung ah na tatse mama a, na banthahatin na hing sugenthei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangman hui tungah na hing domkangtou a, atungah na hing tuongsah nalai a, huipi ging lah ah sah leh hang sena’n na hing nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi zousie ading a kiguotsa shina mun, hing tun ding nahi chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Adihtahin sietna a puagawp mi’n atuohsietna ah kikou nan uleh. Aman akhut azah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Buoi leh lungdong chimawte adingin, ka kap leng sih amah? Mizawngte adingin ka hinna alunggim sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hinanleh hoina ka lam et lai in, ka tungah sietna ahing tunga, vah ka ngah laiin miel ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka lungsim abuoi a khawlna amu sih a, thuohgimna nite’n ahing maituo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nisa taang mulouin ka vahkawi a, mipi kikhawmte lah ah ka dingtou a, panpina ngen in ka kikou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kei pen si-alte sanggampa ka hita a, gam va ngawngsaute lawmpa ka hita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka vunte lah avom gawpa akilip hi, ka gute natna in mei-am sa abang sahgawpta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka kaigingte suunna asuohta a, ka tumgingte mi kapte aw asuohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka mit toh thuhun ka bawl zouta a, Bangdingin nungah kamel nalai diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen tung Pasian akipat ka tanvou ding bang ahia, tualeh vansanga um Bangkimbawltheipa akipat a, ka gouluo ding bang ahi diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migiloute adingin sietna tualeh, thulimlouna nasemte adingin, vangsietna hilou ding adiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aman ka lampite mu lou in, ka kalsuon chinteng simlou ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Dihloupi a ka gamtat a, ahisihleh, solna del a ka kalsuon akinaw leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasian in buhna dihtah in hing buh henlen, ka dihtatna hing theita hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kalsuonte lamgei a apiel a, ka lungtangin ka mitte azui leh, tualeh ka khut a sil sienglou bang ahiei abaan khah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka tu dinga midang in ne mai henlen, ka haichi poute kiphungkal mai heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Numei in ka lungsim a zawl zou a, ahisihleh ka innvengte kotbul a, aguh a buhdap a ka lup khah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka zi in midang ann supieh henlen, midangin amanu luppi heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen tuakhu khelna zumhuoi, tawpkhoh vawt ahi a, thukhente gawt a um ding thulimlouna khat ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tam khu sietna tun dinga katum meikuong ahi a, Tami’n ka sepgimga zousie aphungkaldoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ka suohpa leh ka suohnute, ka tunga lungkimlou a aphun chieng ua, dihloutah a kana bawl leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian in kei ahing kimaituopi chiengin bang kalawta diei? Tualeh ka tungthu gen dinga hat a ka um chiengin, bang chi’n ka dawngta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naubu sunga kei hing bawlpa’n, amaute zong a bawl hilou ahiei mah? Naubu sunga khat in koute, ahing bawl tuoh ka hisih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Mi gentheiten alunggul uh ana pe nuomlou ka hi a, ahisihleh meithaite mit na lawsam sah kana hileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tualeh keima tanga ann kineh a, tagate na hawmkhalou ka hileh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen ka neu lai a kipata, tagate apa banga kana keptou ahita a, tualeh ka nu gilsung akipat, meithaite kana makai ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi koi ahiei puonsil tasam a mangthang ahisihleh, Puonsil neilou tasam mi khat ka mu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A lungsim a kei hing guolzawl ding khop a, ka belam mul a ama kana tuomlum sihleh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />tukhenna mun a panpitu ka nei zieh a, tagate douna a ka khut kana tun khah leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka lieng apat ka ban kie henlen, ka khut zong abul apat kilawikhie heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian apat a tuohsietna khu, kei a dingin chizat huoi ahi a, Athupina ka mu ngam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Sana ka kinepna a ka bawla, sana siengset kungah ka muonna nahi kana chi leh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hausatna thupitah zieh ahiei leh, ka khutten tampi ana mute zieh a, lungnuom kana hileh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ni avah phat laitah ahiei, ahisihleh hapi tangpha tah a kihei, en mai mai kana hileh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tualeh ka lungtang aguh a tuate zawl zoua ana um a, ka kam in ka khutte ana tawp a ahileh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tamte zong thukhenpa’n, agawt ding thulimlouna ahi, aziehpen tung Pasian dinga, dihlou ka hita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Kei hing na mudate vangsietna tunga kana kipah a, ahisihleh atung ua sietna tun zieh a, suh genthei ahi chienga kana awiam khah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />amauh hinna hamsie lawkhum a, khiel dingin ka kam ka phal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka puon inn a umten ama ann ne sih lei, gilva lou ding hi hai a ana chi ngailou ahi uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Khuolzin mi koima gawlzing ah agieh khangai sih a, khuolzin mite adingin, ka kotte honsa in ka koi ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midangte banga ka khelna ka iim a, ka thulimlounate ka lungsim sunga kana iim mang khah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />tuapen mipite ka zauna zieh ahiei mah, ahisihleh innkuonpite simmaw ding zauna zieh a, sip dide a uma kotpu kaanlou ka hi leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aw mi khat beeh in hing zahpi ta mai leh, Ngai in ka deipen khu, Bangkimbawltheipa’n ei dawng henlen, tualeh ka melma in laibu khat a agel khu ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Adihtahin ka liengkou ah ka paw dinga, ka tungah Manglukhu bangin ka kaan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka kalsuonna zousie ama kungah ka phuong dinga, leeng tapa bangin ama ka zuon ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Ka gam keima dou a akikou a, tualeh lou kihousa leitangte zousie akaa khawm uleh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A man pelou a agamga ka neh a, tualeh lou neipa shina ding kana bawlkhah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bu taangin loulingnei barli bu taangin, lingle khaute pou zaw mai heh,” Job thugente abeita hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job khu ama mitmu a ama leh ama akisiemtan zieh in mi thumten dawng nawnlou in atawpsanta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuabep in Ram phunga mi, Buzmi, Barakel tapa Elihu ahing lungthahta hi, Pasian awimaw a ama leh ama akisiemtan ziehin Job tungah a lungthahna akuongdohta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Alawm thumte tungah zong alungthahna akuong hi, aziehpen amaun, adawnna ding neiloupi in Job amawpai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuin tam mi thumte ama sanga upa zaw chiet ahizieh un, Elihu in Job thugen zoutan ana ngahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Elihu in tam mi thumte kamah dawnna a um nawnsih chi amu tahin alungthahna akuongta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuabepin Buz mi Barkel tapa Elihu in adawnga, hichiin achi hi. “Ka kum atawm a khangdawng kahi nalai hi. Hinanleh noute pen na upata uhi. Tuaziehin kana zau a, ka ngaidan noute kungah, kana gen ngam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum tam lamten thu agen dinga, akum upaten pilna azil sah ding hi, ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanleh mihingah lungsim a um a, Bangkimbawltheipa huin ama uh pilna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi thupite khu apil ahi zing tuom sih ua, upaten a theisiem ngitnget tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin, ka thugen ngaikhie unlen, ken zong ka ngaidan ka hing gen ding hi, ka chi ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ngai un, Na thugente uh kana ngah a, na thugen ding dan uh na sui lai un, na ngaituodan uah kabil kana daw hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, na thugente uh hoitahin kana ngaikhie a, Hinanleh na lah ua koiman, Job na niel zou sih ua, adawng thei zong na um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilvangun, pilna imuta uh mihing hilouin, Pasian in ama zou nava na chikha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job in kei demna dingin thu agen sih a, ken noute selnate zanga, ama sel lou ding ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Amauten lamdang asa ua, adawng nawn sih ua, gen ding anei nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ngah lai in hamlouin a ding dildel ua, a dawng nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ken zong ka dawng sam ding a, ka ngaidan ka gendoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aziehpen ken thugending adimin ka nei a, ka sungah hagau in ahing sawl tei tei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngai in, ka gilpi khu pawtdoh na ding neilou uain bang ahia, uain savun thawltha bangin pohkeh dinga mansa ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka hal theina dingin thu hing gen sah un, ka kam kaah in ka dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ken koima deisah tuom ka nei sih ding a, koima ka maitang phat sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aziehpen mi maitang phat dan ka siem sih a, tua hisihleh kei hing siempa’n, ahing lamang paita ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Hinanleh Job aw, ka thugente na ngai inlen, ka thute na ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai in, ka kam ka kaah a, ka kamsunga ka leiin thu agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lungtang dihna akipat in, ka thute ahing pawtkhie a, ka kam in theina sieng agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasian hagau in kei ang bawl a, tualeh Bangkimbawltheipa hu in hinna ahing pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang dawn thei leh hing dawng inlen, na thute ka masangah guoltuoh inlen, dingdet in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />En vawi, kei zong Pasian mai ah nangma bang ka hia, kei zong tungman apat a siem ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka zauhuoina in hing supatau sih henlen, ka khut zong na tungah gih sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Adihtahin nangman ka zahin thu na gen a, tualeh na thugen ging kaza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tatkhelna neilou in ka siengthou a, poikhoilou ka hi, keima ah thulim louna a um vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh Pasian in kei demna ding azieh a mu a, a melma in ahing ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka kengah kol ahing bun a, Ka lampite zousie achiemte hi, na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“En in, tamnah na dih sih hi, Keima’n ka hing dawng ding hi. Aziehpen mihing sangin Pasian athupi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bang dinga Ama dou na hiei? aziehpen Aman athute khat zong azieh ape ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in lam khat lam ni in thu agen a, hinanleh mihingin atheizou sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mang bangin zan a mengmuna bangin, mite imut tuitah a a imut lai bangin, lupna tunga a imut lai bang un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tuabang hun chiengin, Aman mite bil ahon pieh a, tualeh amaute giihna toh apatausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mihing asilbawl a pat akinuaheisah thei nading leh, mihing a pat a akiletsahna a phuol theina dingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aman kokhuh a kipat a, a hagau akep bit pieh kia na ding leh, namsau a amanthaina apat, ahinna ahutdohna ding ahi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mihingte alupna tung uah zong, natna thuoh in aphawhhil thei hi. Tualeh nasatahin agu ataangte anasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuabang hun chiengin ahinna un, ann tui pen nangawn akidah ua, adu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A tahsa akiemmangsuh deu deu a, et apha nawn sih a, nidang a agu atahsain atuom zieh a, kimu theiloute tuin chiengkang bangin, ahing dawhkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A hinna in hankhuh anai a, tualeh ahinkhuo in shina tuntu kung anai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Akunga palai ama dinga thupha theisah dingin, vansawlsieng tul khat lah ah khat beeh, mihing kunga ama dihna ensah ding a um leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />tuachi’n ama khu ama dinga hepisiem ahi a, tualeh ama hankhuh a apei suh louna dinga hundoh in, ama tandoh ding ka muta, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Atahsa khu naupang chingeh hingbang kia dinga, akhangdawng thahat lai ahing bang kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama Pasian kungah athum dinga, adeisahna anga dinga, kipahtahin a mel amu ding hi, aziehpen Aman mihing kungah, adihtatna ape kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman mite mai a la sain, kana khielta a thudih kana heikawi a, hinanleh ahing thuh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Aman ka hinna hankhuh sunga, peisuh lou dingin atankheta hi, tualeh ka hinna in khovah a muta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ngai in Pasian in mihingte tungah, tambang silte ni vei, thum vei dongchieng abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuapen ahinna uh hankhuh sung apat, nualah kia na ding leh amaun, hinna khovah amu theina ding uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Job aw na bil daw inlen, ka thugen ngai in, sip khinkhian in, hing gen ding ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nangman gen ding na neileh, hing dawng in, gen in hing siemtan nuom ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahisihleh hing ngaikhie inlen, sip dide in, pilna ka hing hil ding hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Elihu in athu agenbe nalai a, tambang in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nou mipilten ka thugente na ngai un, tualeh kei lam ah na bil uh hing daw un, nou theina nei miten.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen dangtawngin ann a chep bangin, bil in thute aza chien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eima a dingin thudih itel ding ua, bang pen ahiei ahoi eima lah ah, ikithei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Job in mawna neilou ka hi, hinanleh Pasian in ka dihtatna alamangta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A dih hinanleng zuou thei banga sim ka hita, akhiellou hinanleng ka liemna damtheilou ahita hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Job banga simmawna tui banga, dawnbei koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama pen silhoilou bawlte toh akigop ua, migiloute toh azawhkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aziehpen Job in, Pasian tunga kipah a aum ding, mihing a dingin phattuomna anei sih, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tuaziehin hing ngaikhie un, nou theisiemna neiten, Pasian in silgilou abawl ngai sih a, Bangkimbawltheipa’n thulimlouna abawl ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen mihingte ana sep bang dungzui ua, Pasian in athuh kia ding ahia, tualeh michin a umdan dungzui ua, musah ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Adihtahin Pasian in giloutahin abawl sih dinga, tualeh Bangkimbawltheipa’n thukhen dihna, aheilamdang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Koiin ama leitunga thuneina apieh ahiei? Ahisihleh koiin ahiei, ama leitung pumpi a thunei a aguot?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasian in mihing hinna hagau leh, ahu hakhum khu nualah kia ding hitaleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tahsa zousie a mangthang khawm sieng ding ua, mihing leivui ah akilekia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Na theisiem taah leh tami za inlen, ka thugen ngaikhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thudih homiin vai a hawm thei ding amah? Midih leh silbawltheipa mawpai ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lengpa kunga panna bei na hi chipa leh, milien milalte kunga migilou nahi chi, akilawm ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aman miliente deisah tuom anei sih a, mi zawngte sangin mi haute azatat zaw tuom sih hi, aziehpen amaute ama khut suoh ngen ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mitphiet kaal sungin a shi ua, mite zankhanglai in akithing ua, apeimangta uhi tualeh mihatte zong, mihing khut tellou a lahmangin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Aziehpen Ama mitte’n mihing lampite a en a, akalsuon zousie uh amu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thulimlouna bawlte kibut theina mun ding, khomiel a um sih a, shina limliep zong a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian mai a thukhenna a pei dingin, mihing angaituo nahlai akiphamaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aman athu ala uh kan sese louin, mihatte agawtguoi dimdem a, amaute mun ah midangte akoi zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuaziehin anasepte uh athei a, zankhanglai in amaute alumle a, suhmang in a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Midangte mitmu mama ah, migiloute bangin amauh agawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen Ama zuilouin apielsan ua, alampite angaituo nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun migentheite akap sah ua, akaana kikoute uh Ama kung atung sah ua, Aman suhgenthei a umte kaana aza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama sip khinkhian leh, koi in amawpai thei diei? Aman amai phuol leh koi in ama amu thei diei? Namte leh mimal tungah akibangin aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuazieh in Pasian neilouten vai ahawm louna ding un, tuachilouin mite thang ah a awhkha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Aziehpen mi koiin zong Pasian kunga, gawtna ka thuohta a, ka khiel nawn sih ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka sil muloute hing zilsah inlen, thulimlouna kana bawl tah leh zong, ka bawl nawn sih ding achi akilawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A thuhna na dei bang ahina diei, tuabanga na niel? Aziehpen nangman na tel ding ahia, kei tel ding ahisih hi, tuaziehin na theite gen mai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Theisiemna nei miin ka kungah gen uhenlen, mipil ka thugen angaikhe ten:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Job in theina neiloupi in thu agen a, athugente zong thuhtah theina umloupi ngen ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Job in migiloute dawn banga adawn ziehin, atawp dongin ama ze et in um thei leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Aziehpen aman khelna tungah helna abelap a, ilah uah akhut abenga, Pasian demna thu agen tam seng hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu in agen be kia nalai a, tambang in agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nangman ka dihtatna Pasian dihtatna sangin, asang zaw na chikhu a dih hinava, chi’n na ngaisut amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aziehpen nangman khielsih nanleng zong, nang a dinga bang lemtanna umtuon a, nang a ding a phat tuomna bang a hiei um? na chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma leh na kunga um nalawmte, ke’n ka hing dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van lam entou inlen, mu in, tualeh nang sang a sangzaw meilumte en in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na kheltaah a ahileh Ama demna in bang na bawl ei? Ahisihleh na natatkhelnate punsah a aumleh, Ama dingin bang na bawl ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Dihtat na hileh ama bang na pie ei? ahisihleh na khuta pat in Aman bang amu ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na gitlouna in nangma ang suhnat bangin, midangte asuna thei hi, tualeh na dihtatna in zong, mihing tapa asuphatuom thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Nuoisiena atam seng ziehin, nuoisie a umte akikou zah ua, mihatte khut ziehin, panpina ngen in akikou khie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanleh koiman kei hing siempa Pasian, zankhang lai a thahatna la hing pepa, hei ah aum ei? achi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman leitunga gamsate sangin, eite a hing hil tamzaw a, tualeh tungleng vate sanga pilzaw in eite ahing bawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khunah akikou ua hinanleh, migiloute kiletsahna ziehin koiman adawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Adihtah in Pasian in thumanlou a, houlimna angaikhe sih dinga, Bangkimbawltheipa’n athudon sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ka mu sih chinanlachin zong, vaihawmna amasangah a um nalai hi; tualeh Ama na ngah tei tei ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tuin Ama lungthahna in ahing gawt nailou ziehin, khelnate angai thupi naisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Job in phattuomna bei in, akam akaah a theina tellou in, thu tampi agen a hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Elihu in tambang in thu genzom nalai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hing na thuohpi zou nalai tei tei inlen, Pasian taanga gen ding themkhat ka nei nahlaite ka hing ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ken gamlapi akipat ka theina, ka hing lakhawm dinga, tualeh kei hing siempa kungah, dihtatna ka pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aziehpen adihtahin, ka thute adihlou ahisih a, theina bukim ama khu na kungah a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Envawi, Pasian khu athahat a, tualeh koima asimmaw ngai sih hi; hatna leh pilna a silbawlthei ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’n migiloute ahinkhawi sih a hinanleh, suhgenthei a umte kungah dihna apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman midihtatte akipat amit alakhe ngai sih a, hinanleh leengte toh leengtoupha tung ah aum a, kumtawn a dingin in amauh asukip a, tualeh tawisangin a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh kol busaha aum ua, suhgentheina khau a henchip ahi chieng un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n, anasep uh amauh a ensah a, atatkhelnate uh akiletsahpina u’toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aman thuhilna lam ah abil uh ahon pieh a, thulimlouna akipat a nuakia dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thu aman ua anna asep uleh, lawchingtah in adamsung nite uh amang ding ua, adamsung kumte uh lungkimtah in azang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanleh athuman sih uleh pen, namsau in amangthai ding ua, theina beiin ashi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Alungtang ua lepchiete’n lungthahna akholkhawm ua, Aman amauh akaantom chieng in, panpina ngen in akikou sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khangdawng ahilai un ashi ua, ahinna uh zumhuoitah in abei zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migentheite khu agimthuohna ua kipat ahundoh a, nuoisie na ah abil uh ahonpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aman lungkhamna akipat in, mun lien leh kichingtah, kigahchipna umlouna ah ahing puilut dinga, tualeh na dawkantunga kiluite khu, thauna in a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hinanleh migiloute vaihawm piehna in na dim a, vaihawmna leh thudih in nang ahing man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lungthahna aum zieh in pilvangin, tuachilou in mi simawna lungsim in, ahing hip kha ding a, tua toh kipel dingin tatna thupitah in, ahing panpi thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na hausatnate leh, na thahatnate zousie in na lungkhamnate a kipat, ahing hundoh zou na ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mite a mun ua pat a, satkhieh ahina ding in zan hun lunggul sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pilvang in, thulimlouna lam ah kihei sin, aziehpen gimthuohna sangin tami na telzawta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />En vawi, Pasian khu asilbawltheina a tawisang ahi a, Ama banga thuhil mi koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama lampite guot pieh mi koi ahiei um? ahisihleh Ama kunga na bawlkhielta chi thei koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Mihingten anasep thupisah na dinga, la ana sah uh thei ngitnget in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi chintengin tua khu a muta ua, mi zousie’n gamlapi apat a en uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngai un, Pasian athupi mama a, eite’n itheisiem sih uh, tualeh akum tamdan zong suidoh guol ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman tuimal neu nounoute alatou a, tuate kihitsiengna tuimeite guo in azu sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuami guotuite meizun in ahing tahkhesah a, kiningching tahin mihingte tungah ahing zu suh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aman meilum akiphasah dante, koi in atheisiem dinga, A inn sang akipat a vantoute koi ahiei atheisiem ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Envawi, Aman akimvel ah avahpha a, tualeh tuithuhpi nuoi a khu khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aziehpen Aman tambangin namte vai ahawmpieh a, neh leh taah kichingtahin apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman tunphein akhutte atuom a, achiemtena munte khaw dingin thu apie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuami vantou gingin, Pasian khu thulimlouna huo in, lungthahna leh thangsietna in adim hi, chi aphuongkhie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tamthu ah ka lungtang akiling a, a umna mun ah aphu dutdut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama aw ging lungluttah in ngai unlen, A kam a kipat a pawtdoh a aw ging khu ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman vannuoi pumpi ah tunphe a sawlkhie a, kawlmong dongin aphesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuami nua chiengin a aw aging a, avangletna aw kehin akesah a, tualeh a aw akizah chiengin, tunphe pheding lai atawp sah dieh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasian in aw ging lamdang tahin, vanpi aging sah a, itheisiem theilou uh sil thupite abawl zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen aman vua kungah leitungah kie in achi a, tuamabangin guomalte leh guote kungah nasatahin zuin, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman asiemsa mi zousie in anasep atheina dingun, michinteng khut amelchi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamsate akawhawm sung uah alut ua, akaw sung uah aumden uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sim lam pindan sunga kipat in pingpei ahing kuon a, tualeh mallam hui in kho vawt ahing puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasian huin vuakhal a um sah a, tui lienpite zong akhal sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aman meilum satahte tui apaisah a, A meilum vamte khu athezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama etkolna nuoi ah, athupiehte semkhe dingin leitung maikai ah, akitawl kawi kawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman tamkhu bawlhoina ding ahiei, ahisihleh aleitang tui buoh ding leh, a khotuona sulang dingin, ahing umsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Job aw tami ngaikhie inlen, ding khinkhian inlen, Pasian sillamdang bawlte ngaisut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pasian in meilumte athu thua aum sah dan, leh ameilumte lah a vah ataansah dante, na thei sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Meipite kikhai kawm a apei dante, theina a bukimpa sillamdang bawlte, na thei sih a mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Simlam hui ahing laan zieha, leitung avot dide lai a, na puonsilte hing lum ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vante sumtang himlang banga taah, Ama toh na zahpal ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama kunga bang gen ding ka hi uoi hing hilin, mielna zieh in kouten ka thu gen ding dan uh, kalemkhawm thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thu gen nuom khu ama hil kul ding adiei? Mi koiinzong thu agen leh, adihtahin ama khu nawmval in aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Tuin miten vanlai a taang. Vah ataanphat laitahin a en thei sih a, hinanleh hui alaanga asemmang zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama mallam apat in sana banga vahpha ahing kitawla, Pasian thupina chizathuoi tahin a im kimvel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkimbawltheipa Ama eite mudoh guol ahisih a, Ama silbawltheina leh, vaihawmna leh thudihna kichingtah ah. Ama atungtuong a Aman koima asugenthei sih hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaziehin Ama miten agiing ua, Aman lungtang kipilsahte, koima bangma’n aseptuom sih hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n pingpei lah a kipat in Job adawnga, tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Theina tellou thute a, thumawpna mielsah khu koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ki pasal sah inlen na kawng gah in, ka hing dong dinga, tualeh nangman nang dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Leitung kingahna ka phum laiin hei ah na um ei? theisiemna na neileh hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Alet aneu tetuoh koi ahiei na thei amah? ahisihleh atunga tenakhau hung koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A suongphumte bang tunga kinga ahiei? ahisihleh aninga suongphum koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zingsol aasiten la asah khawm lai u’leh, Pasian tapate zousie nuom a akikou lai un, koi phat ahi uoi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ahisihleh naubu a kipat a, pawtdoh bang mai a apawhkhiit lai a, tuipi kotpi va khakhum koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A puonsil dinga meilum ka bawl lai leh, atuomna dinga miel satah ka bawl lai in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />agamgite ka bawl pieh a, akotpite leh akilna ding ka siem pieh lai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tam tan chieng nang pei thei dinga, aban nang pei thei sih ding, tualeh tanah na tuikihot kisatheite, akhawl ding uh kachi lai in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Na hing pien ni a kipat in zingmawng kungah, thupieh na pekha ngaita amah? Ahisihleh zingkhovah kungah amun ding, na theisah kha ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuabanga leitung aning a tudet a, khuna kipata migiloute thindoh a a um theina ding un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chiemtena nuoi a tungman bangin amel ahing um a, tualeh puon alou a kibum bangin zie nei in adingdoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migiloute apat in avah ukhu tuhtang pieh ahi a, aban lapsangte u’zong sattawng pieh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Tuipi nahte ah nava lut khat a a mah? Ahisihleh tuipi thuh kilkawi teng na pha suohta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Shina kotkhate nang kungah, ahing ki ensah kha ngaita amah? Ahisihleh shina limliep kotkhate, na mukha ngaita amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leivailam let dan na theikheta amah? Tamte zousie na thei kim leh hing hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Khovah umna lampi heisung ahiei? tualeh miel umna mun heisung ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachia a inn zotna lampite na theina dingin, amauh tenna gam ah na zawpi thei na diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuahun lai a na pientah ziehin na thei ei mah? Ahisihleh na kum atam mama taah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Vuate koikhawmna inn ah na lut ngaita amah? Ahisihleh gielpi kikoikhawmna inn, na mu ngaita amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuate lungkham buoina hunte leh, gal kidouna nite adinga ka khet ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khovah hing kihawmzahna mun, zotna lampi heisung ahiei leh? Ahisihleh, suolam huite leitunga, akithezahna mun heisung ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Koi ahiei guotuite luonletna ding tuilam siel a, ahisihleh tunphe leh keeh peina ding, lampi sielpieh koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Koima tenlouna gam leh, mihing umlouna gamdai a guo zusah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangma umlouna gamsie leh, mun guoh khu lungtai sah dinga, tualeh haichite dawn suong sah ding, koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Guo in pa anei amah? Ahisihleh daitui mal hing takhete koi piensah ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Vuakhalte koi naubu sunga hing piengkhie ahi uoi? tualeh van a kipata daituikhalte, hing sungkhie koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuite suong banga atah chiengin, tui thuhpi mai ahing khal sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Nang akilawm mama bawmluoite, khau in na kaankhawm thei amah? Ahisihleh zuheisuhtun kikankhawmte na sut thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang aasi sawmleng khu ahuntah a, kum kihei dungzuiin na heithei ei mah? ahisihleh ngambawm uital leh, anoute na pui koi thei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vanlamte kivaipuohna dan na theina amah? Amauh kivaipuoh dan khu leitungah, na polut thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />“Tui tampi in ahing khu khum theina dingin, meilumte han in na aw na vawhsang thei nangel amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Kawlphete peidoh a na kunga tanah ka um uhi, chi dingin na sawlkhe theina ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pilna sunggil lam a koi a, ahisihleh lungsim sunga, theisiemna pie koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Meilumte sim theina pilna nei koi ahiei? Ahisihleh koi ahiei van tuithawlte, sungbaw thei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bangchih chienga leivuite hing khal a, buonte hing kilomkhawm ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />“Humpibahnei samat ding na sui pieh thei ding amah? Ahisihleh humpibahnei lunlai gilkielte khu, na gilva sah thei na diei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A kuo ua aboh a samat ding abuh lai un, nang ama ua dingin sa nava mat pieh ngai amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Va-ah noute gilkiel a Pasian kunga, kikou a a ann neh ding uh sui a, aleen kawikawi chieng ua, va-ah te ann vape zel khu koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kawl lah a sakelte nou nei hun na thei ei? Ahisihleh sakhiten bang hun chienga, nou anei uh ahiei na chiemte thei ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ha hiza sung agai uh chi na sim thei ei? Tualeh asuoh hun uh na thei ei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amaute abohsuh ua anoute asuoh sah ua, asuohzou chiengun anauvei natna uh abeita hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anoute uh ahing hat ua, gamlah ah hampa nein ahing khanglien ua, avahkhie ua ahing kinuale kia nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Gamsabiltung zalen tah a hakhie koi ahiei? Koi ahiei akhina khaute sutkhie?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A inn dingun gamlah ka bawl a, atenna ding un gamdai ka pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aman khopi sung buoi vengvung khu anuisan giap a, tualeh sakolleng hehte kikou awging angaisah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muoldungte khu ama gamtatna mun ahi a, tualeh hampa hingte asui kawi kawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Gambawngtal in na nna asem nuom diei mah? Ahisihleh na gan ann piehna kuong gei ah, azan gieh nuom diei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Loukaina langkawn khu angawngah, khau in nakhi theina diei leh? Ahisihleh na nua a pei in lou nakai sah theina diei leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Athahat mama ziehin, na muong theina diei leh? tualeh na nasep ama tungah na ngansie ngam na diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na bu leh balte na inn a hing nawnlut ding leh, na buphuol a na bute hing nawnkhawm dingin na gingta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ostrik in ahate ki uongsahtahin azap nanleh hakuite leh, multe vahuong a bangin akituupna amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ostrik in lei lah ah tui atha a, leivui in a op lumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keeng in tuonkek kha ding, ahisihleh gamsain tuon keh, khava chi khuolse louin, amanghil leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama noute nangawn ama a bangloutahin, huhamtah in akeem a, asepgimna khu amawhna suoh khava chi zauna a neisih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aziehpen Pasian in ama pilna alahmang pieh a, theisiemna zong ape sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tai ding a ahate azah chiengin sakol leh, atunga tuongpa anuisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Sakol kungah hatna na pie ei mah? amulnem in angawng na tuom eimah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khauphe bangin ama na zausah thei eimah? anahkawhawm a hu pawt khu chizat ahuoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Akengchin in phaijangte a khuot a, a hatna aki pah pi hi, kidouna kigal thuom mi kituohpi dingin, apawtkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aman zauna anuisan a azau ngai sih a, namsau lah ah akinua hei ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Atungah thaltang bawm aging leng lenga, teipi leh chieng zumte ate set set hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Giinhuoi tah leh thangpaina toh, lei akhuot gup gup a, Pengkul ging azah chiengin, ading khinkhien thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pengkul a gin chiengin, Ehe! achi a, gamlapi akipat kidouna husa leh, gal lamkaite thupieh kikou leh, galnawhna kikou thawm ging zong athei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Nangma pilna zieha mupi leeng tou a, simlam nawt a aha zah ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Muvanlai leengtou a, sangtah a bu ava bawl khu, nangma thupieh zieh ahiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama kawlkhou tungte ah atenga, suongkawhawm muonhuoina munte ah agieh leeng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuana kipat in neh ding asui a, gamlapi a kipat in ganhing amat dingte, agal mu pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anouten zong sisan atawp ua, akithatsa saluongte umna munah ama zong a um hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuathamlouin Mangpa’n Job adawnga, tambangin agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Bangkimbawltheipa toh kikhingpa’n, ama athuhil diei mah? Koi zong Pasian toh kiniel miin,” tami dawng heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in Mangpa adawng a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Envawi, Kei bangmatham ka hisih hi, nang bang ka hing chi dawn diei? Ka khut in kakam ka hum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khatvei ka genta a, hinanleh ka dawng sih ding hi, nivei thu kagenta a, ka ham nawn sih ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n pingpei lah a, kipat in Job adawnga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ki pasal sah inlen na kawng gah inlen, thu ka hing dong dinga, ka kunga na phuondoh ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka vaihawmna bangmalou suohsah ding, na hiei mah? Nangma siem na kitantheina dingin, kei hing mawpai ding na hiei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasian bangin bantha na nei ei mah? Ama bangin aw in, van na ging sah thei ei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Nang leh nang hoina leh, za umna toh kizem inlen, thupina leh kilawmna toh kithuom ve leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lungthahna dimlet zousie, tuibangin bokhe sieng inlen, mi kisathei chinteng en inlen su ngiem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi kiliensah zousie en inlen ngiemkieh sahin, tualeh migiloute adinna mun uah tuonchil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amaute abawn un leivui lah ah phuol khawm inlen, miel kiphuol lah ah amaite uh kaan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n na khut zietlam in, nang ahing hundam thei hi, chi keima mama in na kungah, ka phuongkhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Enin tuin Nangma toh ka siemkhawm, Behemeth in bawngtal bangin, hampa ane hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Enin tuin akawngah a thahatna a um a, tualeh agilpi satel lah ah thahatna aum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amei sidar sing banga khau in apiesah a, amalpi thahuite ka phankhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Agute sum-eng zawl bang mai ahi a, agu leh taangte sia chieng banga khau ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ama khu Pasian khut suohte lah a, akhatna pawl ahi a, ama siempa’n anamsau toh, ama kunglam azuon thei giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adihtahin taangten a ann neh ding apieng sah ua, gamsate zousie khunah akimawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama thamna pah kung nuoite ah aboh a, Luonglau phung leh chihnawng lah ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thamna pah kungbawh limten, ama alie khum ua, tualeh lui gei a huisum singten, ama a imkuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />En vawi luidung tuilet henlen, luonkhum nanleh apatau sih hi, Jordan lui akam dong hum in luong nanleh alung muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Akiven laitahin mi’n siakawi in, ama aman thei diei? ahisihleh anahkuo thangin, avutpailet thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ngakuoi in Leviathan na kaikhe thei diei mah? Ahisihleh khauhuolin alei na khi thei diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anakaw sungah khauhuol na thun thei ding amah? Hisihleh siakawi in akhagu na vut pailet thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aman na kungah zangaina ang ngen ding amah? kam nem in nang ang houpi ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’n nang toh thuhun abawl diei mah? Kumtawn a na suoh dingin, ama na bawl diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vate na khawizuol bangin, ama na khawizuol thei na diei leh, Ahisihleh na nungahte a dingin, ama na khi thei diei leh?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na lawm leh guolten ama mangin, ankuong a lui ding uoi mah! Summet bawlten alah uah, ama a hawm ding uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Avunte siakuoika in na sun thei ding amah? Ahisihleh alutang nga matna teipi in, khaw thei ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atungah na khut koi inlen; kidounate thei ngitnget lachin, na bawlkia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai in, ama tunga kinepna khu athawn ahi a, amu mai in zong mi paikhieh in a um sih diei mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama tohthou ngam ding khopin koima ahangsan sih hi. Ahileh koi ahiei ka mai a ding ngam ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka sankia dinga sil hing pe masa koi ahiei um? Van nuoi pumpi a sil um zousie kei a ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“A tahsa hiengte ahisihleh asilbawltheinate, apien hoinate tungtang thu ah, iim ka nei nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Apuonsil tungnung pen, hawhkhiet pieh thei ding koi ahiei? ahisihleh akamkaina thuo ni toh, ama zuon ngam ding koi ahiei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amai a kotte hong ngam ding koi ahiei? Aha kimvel ah zauhuoina a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lipte akiletsahpi ahia, aguolguol a suoi namna a dettah a, kikhahkhum bang ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kaal a hui lutlouna dinga, kimat zeta kidaaptuo ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khat leh khat akimattuo chiet ua, phelkhiet thei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahahthiei chiengin tunphe aleengkhie a, amitte gel zong zingmawng mitvunte bang mai ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Anakawhawm akipat in meikhu apawtdoh a, meisite aleengdoh zeng zung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anakawhawm akipat in meikhu apawtdoh a, bel a tui kisuong sou leh, hampa kihal khute abang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anahhu in meiholte akuong sah a, tualeh akam apat in mei kuong apawtdoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Angawngah hatna aum ngitnget a, amai ah lunggimna alaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tahsa kihipte kiptah in akimattuo ua, phekhiet guol ahisih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Alungtang suong bangin atah a, bu gawtguoina suong nuoipha bangin atah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama athaw chiengin mi hatte azau ua, azauseng zieh un amauh akimanghil hiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Min ama namsau in sat nanlezong aphatuom sih a, teipi leh thal leh sia zum in dawt nan uleh zong, aphatuom sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aman sia zong bupawl bangin angai a, sum-eng zong sing muotsa bang in angai giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thaltangin ama atai sah zou tuom sih a, ama dingin suong saili kap zong, bupawl bang giap ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Phohbulte zong ama a dingin, bupawl bang giap a ngai ahia, chieng zum a khawte anuisan giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Anuoilang pen belphou keh hiem bang ahia, buonnawi tunga bu satna chieng bangin akipha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuithuh pite zong belta tuisou abang sah a, Tuipi zong bel sunga sathauman bel bangin abawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Aman apeina nuo zousie ataangsah selsol a, miten tuithuhpi khu samkang bang asa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Leitungah ama banga zaulou a siem, ganhing dang a um sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Aman akisang sah leh kiliensah zousie a en a, akisathei zousie tunga leengpa ahi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job in Mangpa adawnga, tambang in agen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Nang silbangkim nabawlthei hi chileh, na sil tupte koima khamthei ahisih, chi ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang, theina neiloupi a, thuhilna phuolgu koi ahiei? chiin na donga, tuaziehin ka theisiemlou kei a dinga, lamdang taluo silte ka gendoh khat a hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai in, ka hing ngen a hi, thu ka hing gen dinga, tualeh nang ka hing phuut dinga, nangman ka kungah phuongdoh in, na hing chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka bil ngel in na thugen ka zata a, tu’n vang ka mit mama in ka hing muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuaziehin keima leh keima ka ki kidah a, leivui leh vut lah ah ka kisiata hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mangpa’n Job kunga tam thute agen zou nuain, “Mangpa’n Teman mi Eliphaz kungah, ka lungthahna nangma tung leh na lawm nite tungah akuong hi; azieh pen ka suohpa Job banga nouten ka tanchin adihtah na genlou zieh uh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin bawngtal sagi leh belamtal sagi kai unlen ka suohpa Job kungah pei unlen, nou a dingin halmang sillat lan unlen, tuachi’n ka suohpa Job in noute adingin thu ahing nget pieh dinga, ama ziehin ka sang dinga, na khelna dungzui un na tung uah ka hing thuh sih ding hi. Ka suohpa Job bangin ka tanchin dihtah nouten na gen sih uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Teman mi Eliphaz leh Shuhmi Bildad leh Namathmi Zopharte ava pei ua, Mangpa’n akung ua agen bangin ava bawlta uhi, tuachi’n Mangpa’n Job thungetnate ana pompiehta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh alawmte dinga thu angetpieh lai in, Mangpa’n Job manna zousie ape kia a, Mangpa’n aguolzawl a, anei leh lamte nidang a sanga aleni a tamzaw apieh be kiata hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah asanggam pasalte leh asanggam numeite zousie leh masang lai a, ameltheite zousie ahing pei khawm ua, a innsungah ama toh ann ane khawm ua, tualeh amaun Mangpa’n atunga atunsah silhoilou zousie tungtangah ama ahenem ua, ahamuon uhi; tualeh michin in sum neu khat chiet leh sana khutsip khat chiet apie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Job khu nidanglai sangin ahun nukhia lamah nahpitah in aguolzawl a, tuachi’n aman belam tul sawm leh li leh sangawngsau tul guh leh bawngtal kop tul khat tualeh sabiltung tul khat aneita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aman tapa sagi leh tanu thum zong anei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amasapen min Jemimah achia, anina nu min Keziah achi a, athumna nu min Keven happuk achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n gamsung pumpi ah Job tanute banga melhoi numei a um sih a, tualeh apa un asanggam pasalte u’lah ah amauh goutan zong ahawm pieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tamte nuain Job kum za leh kum sawmli adam a, atapate, atupate khang li na tandong a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuachi’n Job khu teh mama in kum tampi dam in ashita hi.
  </para>
</usx>
